
# game/a1s5.rpy:3
translate latin a1s5_ace5452e:

    # "I dream a lot the night before the first trial."
    "Nocte ante primam probationem multa somnio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:4
translate latin a1s5_bb50a2bd:

    # "I can't remember most of it, but in the last bit I'm in the throne room, surrounded by dozens of wolves who I assume they're the triumvirates."
    "Plerorumque somniorum meminisse nequeo, sed in ultima parte in aula solii sum, plurimis lupis circumdatus, quos triumviros esse puto."

# game/a1s5.rpy:5
translate latin a1s5_21d70717:

    # "Cato sits on the throne, watching over all of us, his chin on a fist."
    "Cato in solio sedet omnesque nos observat, mento pugno innixo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:6
translate latin a1s5_e1031103:

    # "Meanwhile, Amicus is in the center, doing some type of breakdance."
    "Interea Amicus in medio est atque quoddam saltationis acrobaticae genus agit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:7
translate latin a1s5_db69c1b2:

    # "He's athletic and light on his feet before throwing off his cape and doing a handstand."
    "Athleticus est agilique pede saltat; deinde pallium abicit et manibus insistit, corpore inverso."

# game/a1s5.rpy:8
translate latin a1s5_c275c0b3:

    # "Then he spins on his head for a while as the wolves around him cheer."
    "Tum aliquantisper capite nititur ac circumagitur, dum lupi circumstantes acclamant."

# game/a1s5.rpy:9
translate latin a1s5_8d99cf67:

    # "Even Cato claps reluctantly."
    "Etiam Cato invitus plaudit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:10
translate latin a1s5_263bd92e:

    # "Meanwhile, Cassius has his paw to his mouth, realizing that he's been beaten, his paper bones incapable of withstanding such incredible moves."
    "Cassius autem manum ori admovet, intellegens se victum esse, quippe cuius ossa chartacea tam mirabiles motus sustinere nequeant."

# game/a1s5.rpy:11
translate latin a1s5_73b63a1b:

    # "Then I wake up."
    "Deinde evigilo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:13
translate latin a1s5_5adeb5a7:

    # "I open my eyes and see the dark outline of the ceiling above me, the lights automatically coming on to a dim, yellow glow."
    "Oculos aperio atque obscuram laquearis speciem supra me video; lumina sponte accenduntur, tenuem flavamque lucem fundentia."

# game/a1s5.rpy:14
translate latin a1s5_0a88b595:

    # "I hear Amicus's soft snoring next to me and look over, seeing that he's flat on his back, mouth open and hugging one of his many pillows to his chest."
    "Mitem Amici stertentis sonum iuxta me audio atque eum aspicio: supinus iacet ore aperto, unum e multis pulvillis pectori adstringens."

# game/a1s5.rpy:15
translate latin a1s5_34c00563:

    # "I roll onto my back, feeling the anxiety of the upcoming trial return."
    "In dorsum me verto atque anxietatem de probatione imminente redire sentio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:16
translate latin a1s5_6cb797ec:

    # "After a while, I whisper up at the ceiling."
    "Post aliquantum temporis ad laquearia susurro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:17
translate latin a1s5_f04abe25:

    # m "\"Com, what time is it?\""
    m "\"Com, quota hora est?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:18
translate latin a1s5_15d64ac2:

    # "Com whispers back."
    "Com mihi vicissim susurrat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:19
translate latin a1s5_e873b6b7:

    # com "\"Half-past the first hour.\""
    com "\"Prima hora et dimidia.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:20
translate latin a1s5_ffc07cb2:

    # "So I have at least three hours left before I can get up and get ready."
    "Ita mihi saltem tres horae supersunt antequam surgere atque me parare possim."

# game/a1s5.rpy:21
translate latin a1s5_3b161562:

    # "I close my eyes to try and get more sleep."
    "Oculos claudo ut rursus dormire coner."

# game/a1s5.rpy:22
translate latin a1s5_9b9610b9:

    # "It's hard though, mainly because my future could be determined today."
    "Difficile tamen est, maxime quod futura mea hodie constitui possunt."

# game/a1s5.rpy:23
translate latin a1s5_3749fb13:

    # "Amicus told me that we really only need to win this trial to win the whole thing."
    "Amicus mihi dixit nos hac una probatione victores esse oportere ut universum certamen vincamus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:24
translate latin a1s5_c1fa5495:

    # "Because if we win tomorrow, that means that Cassius will at least have to partake in the combat trial, if not outright lose if we win the second trial."
    "Nam si cras vincimus, Cassius saltem in probatione pugnae certare debebit, nisi omnino vincitur si secundam probationem vincamus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:25
translate latin a1s5_8950aa4a:

    # "And according to Amicus, Cassius has absolutely no chance in {i}pugnu{/i} combat, and he knows that."
    "At, ut Amicus ait, Cassius in pugna {i}pugnu{/i} nulla prorsus spe vincendi est, idque ipse scit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:26
translate latin a1s5_f46d2e07:

    # "While he might still participate in the second trial to save some face, he'd have to withdraw for the third, otherwise face outright humiliation."
    "Etiamsi in secunda probatione certare pergat ut aliquid dignitatis servet, a tertia recedere debebit, alioquin apertam ignominiam subibit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:27
translate latin a1s5_455fba13:

    # "So if we win tomorrow, I'm almost guaranteed a way home..."
    "Ita, si cras vincimus, mihi reditus domum paene certus est..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:28
translate latin a1s5_698428cb:

    # "The thought that this whole fiasco could be over soon brings mixed feelings for me."
    "Cogitatio totam hanc rem infelicem brevi finiri posse varios in me affectus movet."

# game/a1s5.rpy:29
translate latin a1s5_1a955bd9:

    # "While I'm going to go home when I get the chance, I can't help but feel a little sad at the idea of leaving Amicus and the palace."
    "Quamquam domum redibo simul ac facultas data erit, paulum tristitiae sentio cum cogito me Amicum atque palatium relicturum esse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:30
translate latin a1s5_e9940c89:

    # "We're good friends at this point, and the thought that I might just get dropped off and never see him again..."
    "Iam boni amici sumus, atque cogitatio me fortasse domum reduci posse nec eum umquam rursus visurum esse..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:31
translate latin a1s5_0e4c5cd2:

    # "I sigh and listen to the wolf's rhythmic snores, the sound so soft and gentle that rather than keeping me awake, it starts to lull me back to sleep..."
    "Suspiro et aequales lupi stertentis sonos audio: tam mites blandi sunt ut, potius quam me vigilantem teneant, rursus me in somnum ducere incipiant..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:34
translate latin a1s5_c915adae:

    # "And again, I find myself floating as that wide, vacuous conscience that seems to bleed over the boundaries of any sort of individuality."
    "Iterumque me fluctuare sentio, velut amplam illam vacuamque conscientiam quae fines cuiuslibet individualitatis transcendere videtur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:35
translate latin a1s5_bd7eafa8:

    # "I don't panic this time."
    "Hoc tempore non expavesco."

# game/a1s5.rpy:36
translate latin a1s5_ba3d4018:

    # "I'm used to the feeling, knowing that it's just a dream, that it will pass."
    "Huic sensui iam adsuevi; scio enim somnium tantum esse ac praeteriturum."

# game/a1s5.rpy:37
translate latin a1s5_6e8c233a:

    # "I also sense that other presence above me, even wider than I am."
    "Illam quoque aliam praesentiam supra me sentio, me ipso etiam ampliorem."

# game/a1s5.rpy:38
translate latin a1s5_eb979d57:

    # "They've been following me around since I got on that ship."
    "Me circumsequitur ex quo navem illam conscendi."

# game/a1s5.rpy:39
translate latin a1s5_a735a72f:

    # "Knowing that someone else is there calms me further, and I wait, wondering if they'll talk to me again."
    "Quod alium ibi adesse scio, magis etiam tranquillus fio; exspecto igitur, quaerens an iterum me allocuturus sit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:40
translate latin a1s5_486ae821:

    # "They do."
    "Iterum me alloquitur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:41
translate latin a1s5_c3e02442:

    # "\"I am still curious.\""
    "\"Adhuc scire cupio.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:42
translate latin a1s5_b3e4c959:

    # "I try to talk back this time, ask them what they're curious about exactly, but I don't have a mouth to speak with."
    "Hoc tempore respondere conor atque quaerere quidnam scire cupiat, sed os quo loquar non habeo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:43
translate latin a1s5_a9f56f4f:

    # "They seem to hear me though, and in response I sense gentle amusement mixed with..."
    "Audire me tamen videtur; responsum eius sentio velut mitem hilaritatem cum..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:44
translate latin a1s5_739a7b4b:

    # "Fascination?"
    "Admiratione?"

# game/a1s5.rpy:45
translate latin a1s5_21eb5a76:

    # "\"Many, many things, but once again, I'm afraid I have to keep it short.\""
    "\"Multas, multas res; sed rursus, ut vereor, paucis loqui debeo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:46
translate latin a1s5_0df5b9fc:

    # "I wait expectantly."
    "Intentus exspecto."

# game/a1s5.rpy:47
translate latin a1s5_061e27b9:

    # "\"Do you feel that Amicus would be capable of his duties as emperor of Adastra?\""
    "\"Censesne Amicum muneribus imperatoris Adastrae fungi posse?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:52
translate latin a1s5_816f20ad:

    # "\"Ah, how...interesting.\""
    "\"Ah, quam...singulare.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:55
translate latin a1s5_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:58
translate latin a1s5_d7676c1e:

    # "\"I see...perhaps you need more time. There is still much, much more to learn.\""
    "\"Intellego...fortasse plus temporis tibi opus est. Multa, permulta etiam discenda sunt.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:60
translate latin a1s5_8176c70e:

    # "The presence above me starts to dissipate, and so do I."
    "Praesentia illa supra me dissipari incipit, ego quoque."

# game/a1s5.rpy:63
translate latin a1s5_8d5c2ec6:

    # "I'm standing awkwardly in the bathroom while another wolf moves busily around me, making short, clipped comments about my odd shape and tiny stature."
    "In balneo inconcinne sto, dum alius lupus circa me sedulo versatur, brevibus abruptisque verbis miram corporis mei formam atque exiguam staturam reprehendens."

# game/a1s5.rpy:64
translate latin a1s5_721a66a9:

    # "He's the first wolf I've seen that isn't part of the imperial family, so I keep trying not to stare at him while he turns my head left and right, smudging a black substance on my face while he does."
    "Primus hic lupus est quem viderim qui non ad familiam imperialem pertineat; ideo eum nimis intueri caveo, dum caput meum dextrorsum sinistrorsumque vertit et rem quandam nigram vultui meo illinit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:66
translate latin a1s5_5be76f51:

    # "Meanwhile, Amicus stands behind us, his face showing a mixture of amusement and concern."
    "Amicus autem post nos stat, vultu hilaritatem cum sollicitudine mixtam ostendente."

# game/a1s5.rpy:67
translate latin a1s5_7a37b0cd:

    # "I raise an eyebrow at him through the mirror, but he just shrugs in response."
    "Per speculum eum aspiciens supercilium tollo, sed ille umeros tantum attollit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:68
translate latin a1s5_5a9fcb63:

    # "Old Wolf" "\"Do not move your...face, please.\""
    "Old Wolf" "\"Noli...vultum tuum movere, quaeso.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:69
translate latin a1s5_50a5b051:

    # "I look straight ahead again, letting him smudge the black makeup on my face, still trying not to stare."
    "Rursus recta ante me aspicio eumque pigmentum nigrum vultui illinere sino, adhuc cavens ne nimis intuear."

# game/a1s5.rpy:70
translate latin a1s5_d87e9324:

    # "He's hunched and droopy, wearing some type of monocle with flashing lights."
    "Incurvus est ac flaccidus, quoddam vitrum monoculare luminibus coruscantibus praeditum gerens."

# game/a1s5.rpy:71
translate latin a1s5_5ab2f777:

    # "The lens sticks out every now and then with a mechanical droning sound as he examines his work."
    "Lens subinde prominet, machinario fremitu edito, dum opus suum inspicit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:72
translate latin a1s5_e78a717d:

    # "Also, I'm in a dress."
    "Praeterea, stolam gesto."

# game/a1s5.rpy:73
translate latin a1s5_aed67eeb:

    # "There's no getting around it; I'm in a blue, tight-fitting gown that's covered in intricate, gold designs."
    "Rem dissimulare nequeo: caeruleam vestem talarem corpori artam gesto, exquisitis ornamentis aureis tectam."

# game/a1s5.rpy:74
translate latin a1s5_a8bcffd7:

    # "It's beautiful, no doubt, but I'm not really one for dresses, and I feel my face heating up with embarrassment every time I look into the mirror."
    "Pulchra quidem est, sine dubio; sed vestes muliebres mihi non placent, atque vultum meum pudore incalescere sentio quoties in speculum aspicio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:75
translate latin a1s5_cd53d8b1:

    # "So instead, I focus on staring at the wall or Amicus."
    "In parietem igitur aut Amicum potius oculos figo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:76
translate latin a1s5_1900ea00:

    # m "\"So why aren't {i}you{/i} getting dressed up?\""
    m "\"Cur igitur {i}tu{/i} non ornatior vestiris?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:77
translate latin a1s5_e4f84564:

    # "Old Wolf" "\"Do not speak, please.\""
    "Old Wolf" "\"Noli loqui, quaeso.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:79
translate latin a1s5_e74d22f9:

    # a "\"Me? Well, I'm already dressed the part of the emperor!\""
    a "\"Ego? At iam imperatoris habitu vestitus sum!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:81
translate latin a1s5_21c5216e:

    # "Amicus fans out his cape with both paws."
    "Amicus pallium utraque manu expandit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:82
translate latin a1s5_52299d2a:

    # "I start to roll my eyes, but stop myself before the wolf can yell at me again."
    "Oculos in caelum vertere incipio, sed me cohibeo antequam lupus rursus me increpare possit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:83
translate latin a1s5_f032b645:

    # "I realize that he's painting black stripes on my face, and it immediately reminds me of tiger stripes."
    "Intellego eum lineas nigras vultui meo pingere, quae statim tigridis lineas mihi in memoriam revocant."

# game/a1s5.rpy:84
translate latin a1s5_e8917425:

    # "After that's done, he does the same to the exposed parts of my arms."
    "Hoc perfecto, idem in partibus brachiorum nudis facit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:85
translate latin a1s5_23bce18c:

    # "Old Wolf" "\"Remember not to touch or itch at your face. Also, keep your arms away from your body unless you want to ruin the fabric with powder.\""
    "Old Wolf" "\"Memento ne vultum tangas neve scalpere incipias. Brachia quoque a corpore remota tene, nisi velis pulveribus vestem corrumpere.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:86
translate latin a1s5_ec796712:

    # "The wolf finally steps back, giving a snort of approval before turning and stuffing his equipment into his bag."
    "Lupus tandem recedit ac fremitu approbat; deinde se vertit instrumentaque sua in peram congerit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:88
translate latin a1s5_38471715:

    # a "\"Thank you.\""
    a "\"Gratias.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:89
translate latin a1s5_2408fa65:

    # "Old Wolf" "\"You're welcome.\""
    "Old Wolf" "\"Libenter.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:90
translate latin a1s5_3c1a5d51:

    # "And with that, the old wolf hurries out of the bathroom, leaving the two of us alone."
    "His dictis, senex lupus e balneo festinat nosque solos relinquit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:91
translate latin a1s5_5120eaeb:

    # "I stand there a moment, staring at myself in the mirror, feeling like a circus attraction."
    "Aliquantisper ibi sto meque in speculo intueor, velut spectaculum in circo exhibendum."

# game/a1s5.rpy:92
translate latin a1s5_e69c9430:

    # m "\"I look...awful.\""
    m "\"Foedus...videor.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:95
translate latin a1s5_241a1ee4:

    # "Amicus coughs and steps up quickly, resting a paw on my shoulder."
    "Amicus tussit, celeriter accedit atque manum umero meo imponit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:97
translate latin a1s5_98c01a5e:

    # a "\"You look very good, actually. Very elegant.\""
    a "\"Immo, pulcherrime conspiceris. Elegantissime.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:98
translate latin a1s5_809f91b2:

    # "I look up at the wolf and see him smiling at me."
    "Lupum suspicio eumque mihi arridentem video."

# game/a1s5.rpy:99
translate latin a1s5_236eac39:

    # "I don't know if he's just trying to make me feel better, but then again, I suppose wolves don't really have any idea of what human beauty standards are."
    "Nescio an me tantum solari conetur; sed rursus puto lupos ignorare quid homines pulchrum iudicent."

# game/a1s5.rpy:100
translate latin a1s5_93d43435:

    # "I look at the black stripes on my face."
    "Lineas nigras in vultu meo aspicio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:101
translate latin a1s5_f803c8dc:

    # m "\"Are these tiger stripes?\""
    m "\"Suntne hae tigridis lineae?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:103
translate latin a1s5_6af1168d:

    # "Amicus raises his eyebrows."
    "Amicus supercilia tollit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:104
translate latin a1s5_372f7dec:

    # a "\"Yes, actually. You have tigers on Earth?\""
    a "\"Sunt quidem. Vos quoque in Terra tigres habetis?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:105
translate latin a1s5_f9f6b268:

    # m "\"Yeah...is this like, okay with them, not offensive? It looks like a joke.\""
    m "\"Habemus...num hoc illis placet neque contumeliosum est? Ridiculum videtur.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:107
translate latin a1s5_eaaba61a:

    # a "\"Offensive? Why would it be offensive? We're honoring Meera with this dance.\""
    a "\"Contumeliosum? Cur contumeliosum sit? Hac saltatione Meeram honoramus.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:108
translate latin a1s5_745f0138:

    # m "\"If you're sure...\""
    m "\"Si certus es...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:110
translate latin a1s5_b29f2789:

    # a "\"Of course I'm sure! And you don't look like a joke, you look like a strong, beautiful, Hindo tigress.\""
    a "\"Certissimus sum! Nec ridiculus videris: fortis formosaque tigris Hindica videris.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:111
translate latin a1s5_22c545b4:

    # "I sigh again, still awkwardly holding my arms away from the dress, feeling stiff."
    "Iterum suspiro, adhuc inconcinne brachia a veste removens, atque rigidus mihi videor."

# game/a1s5.rpy:112
translate latin a1s5_4fe86f18:

    # m "\"When does this all start?\""
    m "\"Quando haec omnia incipient?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:114
translate latin a1s5_3095316f:

    # a "\"Well, for ME in about twenty minutes, but for you, another hour or so.\""
    a "\"MIHI quidem post viginti fere minuta; tibi autem post aliam fere horam.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:115
translate latin a1s5_ff1c32bc:

    # m "\"Alright, anything I should expect before it starts?\""
    m "\"Bene; estne aliquid quod ante initium exspectare debeam?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:116
translate latin a1s5_0d7de5e0:

    # a "\"Not much, the triumvirates will be watching through video link, so only Cato will be there to judge.\""
    a "\"Non multum: triumviratus per nexum imaginum spectabunt; itaque Cato solus ibi aderit ut iudicet.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:117
translate latin a1s5_2d6ee573:

    # m "\"Oh.\""
    m "\"O.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:118
translate latin a1s5_4711f397:

    # a "\"Keep in mind that it will all be televised live to the rest of Adastra, so...\""
    a "\"Memineris omnia, dum aguntur, per televisionem toti reliquae Adastrae ostentum iri; itaque...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:119
translate latin a1s5_049e1c4f:

    # "Amicus sees the look on my face."
    "Amicus vultum meum videt."

# game/a1s5.rpy:121
translate latin a1s5_7831d1eb:

    # a "\"Erm...maybe I shouldn't have told you that?\""
    a "\"Hem...fortasse hoc tibi dicere non debui?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:122
translate latin a1s5_12cf47ec:

    # m "\"ALL of Adastra? LIVE!?\""
    m "\"TOTI ADASTRAE? DUM AGITUR!?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:123
translate latin a1s5_fa8a3b03:

    # a "\"Don't worry! No one will actually be there in person, so just...pretend, I guess.\""
    a "\"Noli timere! Nemo corpore ipse aderit; itaque tantum...simula, opinor.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:124
translate latin a1s5_034822bb:

    # m "\"Why DID you just tell me that?\""
    m "\"Cur hoc mihi MODO dixisti?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:126
translate latin a1s5_8a9e2875:

    # a "\"Well, I had planned on you watching the first half of the trial in the dining room. You'll know how everything is going until it's your turn.\""
    a "\"Te priorem probationis partem in triclinio spectare volueram. Scies quomodo omnia procedant donec ad te ventum erit.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:127
translate latin a1s5_411e2a61:

    # "I swallow hard."
    "Aegre deglutio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:129
translate latin a1s5_3cd18dd3:

    # a "\"I didn't mean to keep that from you, I just thought you might know this would be the case...the entire moon pays very close attention to these trials.\""
    a "\"Hoc te celare nolui; tantum putavi te iam scire ita futurum esse...tota luna has probationes attentissime spectat.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:130
translate latin a1s5_3d810a2f:

    # "He's right, I guess I sort of did assume that would be the case, but now that it's actually happening..."
    "Recte dicit; credo me iam suspicatum esse ita futurum esse, sed nunc, cum re vera fiat..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:131
translate latin a1s5_77f32cc4:

    # "I feel like I'm gonna pass out."
    "Mihi videor animo defecturus esse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:132
translate latin a1s5_932ffe3a:

    # "Maybe I'll get lucky and it'll happen when Meera dies during the dance."
    "Fortasse fortuna favebit idque accidet cum Meera in saltatione moritur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:134
translate latin a1s5_a1eebe62:

    # a "\"Listen, you'll be fine. We'll win this and before you know it, I'll be emperor and our problems will be over.\""
    a "\"Audi, bene tibi erit. Hanc probationem vincemus, et antequam sentias imperator ero omniaque mala nostra finientur.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:135
translate latin a1s5_de01aecf:

    # "Again, the idea of having my way home all but guaranteed in the next hour..."
    "Iterum cogito reditum mihi domum proxima hora paene certum fore..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:136
translate latin a1s5_9e0eb29a:

    # "It reminds me of the thoughts I'd had last night."
    "Cogitationes hesternae noctis mihi in memoriam redeunt."

# game/a1s5.rpy:137
translate latin a1s5_663cd1b2:

    # m "\"So, uh, when I do get home, is that gonna be the last time I'll see you?\""
    m "\"Igitur, hem, cum domum rediero, num hoc erit ultimum tempus quo te videbo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:139
translate latin a1s5_9f834575:

    # "The corners of Amicus's mouth twitch down in a frown, but only for a moment before he smiles again."
    "Ora Amici ad tristitiam demittuntur, sed paulisper tantum; deinde rursus arridet."

# game/a1s5.rpy:141
translate latin a1s5_293c1241:

    # a "\"Well, I suppose that's up to you. With unlimited access to the stretch, I might be able to make visits every now and then. Would you like that?\""
    a "\"Puto id in tua potestate esse. Cum mihi Propulsione Dilatatoria sine ullis finibus uti licebit, fortasse subinde te visitare potero. Visne?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:142
translate latin a1s5_e25826cf:

    # "I don't even have to think about it."
    "Ne cogitare quidem debeo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:143
translate latin a1s5_c806ebc0:

    # m "\"Yeah.\""
    m "\"Ita.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:145
translate latin a1s5_71643afe:

    # "Amicus's smile widens."
    "Amicus latius arridet."

# game/a1s5.rpy:146
translate latin a1s5_b5d3b8fa:

    # a "\"I would as well.\""
    a "\"Ego quoque volo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:147
translate latin a1s5_e1510eba:

    # m "\"Yeah, I mean, you're my friend, and I'd wanna hear about the results of your empire.\""
    m "\"Ita: amicus meus es, et de eventibus imperii tui audire velim.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:149
translate latin a1s5_3a2a4472:

    # "But then Amicus's smile falters, then turns into a frown."
    "Sed risus Amici languescit atque in tristitiam mutatur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:150
translate latin a1s5_df8ec4bc:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"Quid?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:151
translate latin a1s5_11ef72f6:

    # "The wolf is quiet for a moment, then his ears flatten."
    "Lupus paulisper tacet, deinde aures demittit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:152
translate latin a1s5_c4d62fec:

    # a "\"I er...forgot the reason you're here in the first place.\""
    a "\"Ego, hem...causam ob quam omnino hic es oblitus eram.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:153
translate latin a1s5_085c673b:

    # "For a moment, I don't know what he's talking about...then I do."
    "Aliquantisper quid dicat nescio...deinde intellego."

# game/a1s5.rpy:154
translate latin a1s5_c96f7514:

    # "We're not even supposed to know each other exists."
    "Alter alterum exstare ne scire quidem debemus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:155
translate latin a1s5_8649f18a:

    # "This whole thing is against the law."
    "Tota haec res contra leges est."

# game/a1s5.rpy:156
translate latin a1s5_4574f78d:

    # m "\"Oh...so I guess we wouldn't be able to do that, huh?\""
    m "\"Oh...ergo id facere non poterimus, ut videtur?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:157
translate latin a1s5_7e2614ca:

    # "Amicus bites his lip, then shakes his head."
    "Amicus labrum mordet, deinde caput quatit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:159
translate latin a1s5_d7f884bb:

    # a "\"We'll figure it out, but now is not the time for that. We have a trial to win!\""
    a "\"Aliquid excogitabimus, sed nunc non est eius rei tempus. Probationem vincere debemus!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:161
translate latin a1s5_9e75dbd1:

    # "Amicus turns to me and, after a little hesitation, pulls me into a quick side hug, carefully avoiding the black powder on my arm."
    "Amicus ad me se vertit atque, paulum cunctatus, a latere me breviter amplectitur, pulverem nigrum in brachio meo diligenter vitans."

# game/a1s5.rpy:162
translate latin a1s5_3fccf4a0:

    # a "\"We'll talk more afterwards over a celebratory dinner, alright?\""
    a "\"Plura postea in cena qua victoriam celebremus dicemus, bene?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:163
translate latin a1s5_e15aa213:

    # "The absolute confidence and reassurance in Amicus's voice calms me just a little, and I manage a small smile."
    "Summa fiducia atque firmitas vocis Amici paulum me tranquillat, et tenuiter arridere possum."

# game/a1s5.rpy:164
translate latin a1s5_b59cb80e:

    # m "\"Alright...\""
    m "\"Bene...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:166
translate latin a1s5_1891a5b1:

    # a "\"Good! And a, uh...little more celebration after that, if you get my meaning.\""
    a "\"Optime! Et, hem...postea paulo etiam plus celebrabimus, si quid dicam intellegis.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:167
translate latin a1s5_8ae59e05:

    # "I had almost forgotten about THAT."
    "ILLUD paene oblitus eram."

# game/a1s5.rpy:168
translate latin a1s5_6ae30550:

    # m "\"Amicus...\""
    m "\"Amice...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:170
translate latin a1s5_4a353335:

    # a "\"If you want, if you want...\""
    a "\"Si vis, si vis...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:172
translate latin a1s5_f37fd95b:

    # "Amicus chuckles before his ears perk up, his personal Com talking to him in a quiet, babbling sound."
    "Amicus subridet, deinde aures erigit: Com eius privatus ei quieto quodam murmure loquitur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:173
translate latin a1s5_582207b4:

    # a "\"Alright, that's my cue. Head to the dining room if you'd like to watch. Otherwise, Com will tell you when to leave for the throne room, alright?\""
    a "\"Bene, hoc mihi signum est. In triclinium vade si spectare vis. Alioquin Com te certiorem faciet quando ad aulam solii proficisci debeas, bene?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:174
translate latin a1s5_61f1b4ab:

    # "I nod, and Amicus gives me one last pat on the shoulder before turning away."
    "Annuo, et Amicus umerum meum semel adhuc leviter percutit antequam se avertat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:175
translate latin a1s5_415e6b17:

    # m "\"Um, good luck. I know you're gonna do great.\""
    m "\"Hem, fortuna tibi faveat. Scio te optime facturum esse.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:178
translate latin a1s5_468074b0:

    # "Amicus waves at me before walking out the door, leaving me alone to wait."
    "Amicus mihi manu salutat, deinde per ianuam egreditur meque solum exspectantem relinquit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:180
translate latin a1s5_2b1f563d:

    # "I move to the bed and sit down, carefully resting my arms out to the side, wishing that they'd applied the makeup a little closer to the dance so I didn't have to walk around like a scarecrow."
    "Ad lectum accedo et consido, brachia a lateribus diligenter removens; utinam pigmentum propius saltationis tempus illinissent, ne velut terricula agrorum circumire deberem."

# game/a1s5.rpy:181
translate latin a1s5_8049bbf2:

    # "I realize pretty quickly that sitting here in silence is only making me more nervous, so I slowly get up, making my way to the main hall."
    "Mox intellego me hic in silentio sedentem magis tantum anxium fieri; itaque lente surgo et ad atrium principale contendo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:184
translate latin a1s5_9ba38874:

    # "As usual, the halls are empty."
    "Ut solet, porticus vacuae sunt."

# game/a1s5.rpy:185
translate latin a1s5_8f5fe9ba:

    # "The only people living here are the imperial siblings, Cato, and Neferu."
    "Hic tantum fratres sororque imperiales, Cato et Neferu habitant."

# game/a1s5.rpy:186
translate latin a1s5_bf67599a:

    # "The old makeup wolf is the only other person that I've seen over the past two and a half weeks that I've been here."
    "Senex ille lupus qui me pinxit solus alius est quem his duabus et dimidia hebdomadibus, ex quo hic sum, viderim."

# game/a1s5.rpy:187
translate latin a1s5_1f359ea8:

    # "It makes me think that I still want to see the city before I leave...if I leave."
    "Ita cogito me urbem etiam videre velle antequam abeam...si abiero."

# game/a1s5.rpy:188
translate latin a1s5_20028f8d:

    # "I block that thought from my brain, trying not to think of what might happen if these trials go poorly for us."
    "Illam cogitationem ab animo arceo, cavens ne cogitem quid accidere possit si hae probationes nobis male cedant."

# game/a1s5.rpy:189
translate latin a1s5_d5c4e7f3:

    # "Instead, I try to let the bright sunshine and fresh morning air calm my nerves."
    "Potius nitentem solem atque recentem aerem matutinum anxietatem meam sedare sino."

# game/a1s5.rpy:192
translate latin a1s5_b12deb5e:

    # "Eventually, I make my way to the dining room and when I look in, I see Alex sitting on one of the beds."
    "Tandem ad triclinium pervenio; intro aspiciens Alex in uno e lectis sedentem video."

# game/a1s5.rpy:195
translate latin a1s5_edcb37d6:

    # "His ears perk up as he sees me, eyes widening in surprise."
    "Cum me videt, aures erigit oculosque admiratione dilatat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:196
translate latin a1s5_aa3f0962:

    # al "\"Oh! Hello, [mc]...how are you?\""
    al "\"Oh! Salve, [mc]...ut vales?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:197
translate latin a1s5_869abc8e:

    # "He stares at my face, then down at my costume."
    "Vultum meum intuetur, deinde ad habitum meum oculos demittit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:198
translate latin a1s5_7acf5d9b:

    # "I feel myself turning red and I desperately wish that I had stayed in Amicus's room."
    "Me erubescere sentio atque vehementer opto me in Amici cubiculo mansisse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:199
translate latin a1s5_bec49706:

    # "I'm able to swallow the embarrassment down for now, though."
    "Pudorem tamen interim reprimere possum."

# game/a1s5.rpy:200
translate latin a1s5_3ced489e:

    # "I know Alex pretty well, after all."
    "Alex enim satis bene novi."

# game/a1s5.rpy:201
translate latin a1s5_9e56b595:

    # m "\"Where's {i}your{/i} costume?\""
    m "\"Ubi est {i}tuus{/i} habitus?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:202
translate latin a1s5_a5039f4a:

    # "At this point I feel like I'm the only person being made to play dress up."
    "Iam mihi videor solus esse qui personam alienam induere cogatur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:203
translate latin a1s5_8ed9a7ad:

    # "I sit down on the middle bed, not wanting to be directly across from the cat where he'd have to stare at me."
    "In lecto medio consido, nolens directe exadverso feli sedere, ubi me intueri cogeretur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:205
translate latin a1s5_7c7ca408:

    # al "\"Er, should I be in one?\""
    al "\"Hem, num tali veste indui debeo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:206
translate latin a1s5_8619f2c6:

    # "I shrug."
    "Umeros tollo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:207
translate latin a1s5_6cc2453e:

    # m "\"I don't know, they put me in one, obviously.\""
    m "\"Nescio; me certe ea induerunt, ut vides.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:209
translate latin a1s5_eb76323a:

    # al "\"Obviously...and the powder, too.\""
    al "\"Ut video...et pulvere quoque ornaverunt.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:210
translate latin a1s5_282940ac:

    # "I glare at Alex."
    "Alex truculenter aspicio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:212
translate latin a1s5_a143b657:

    # al "\"I mean, you look good, very bold.\""
    al "\"Dico te pulchre conspici, atque insigniter.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:213
translate latin a1s5_13eb20aa:

    # m "\"So why the hell aren't you dressed up as Meera? We're doing the same dance, right?\""
    m "\"Cur igitur, malum, Meerae habitu non vestitus es? Eandem saltationem agimus, nonne?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:215
translate latin a1s5_2eb62d70:

    # al "\"Well, yes, though Cassius instructed that I be in my underwear. Actually, I think I'd prefer your situation.\""
    al "\"Agimus quidem; sed Cassius iussit me indusio tantum vestiri. Immo, condicionem tuam praeferrem.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:216
translate latin a1s5_910f899d:

    # m "\"Sure.\""
    m "\"Sane.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:218
translate latin a1s5_235913c3:

    # al "\"Seriously! You think I want all of Adastra to see my naked torso?\""
    al "\"Re vera! Putasne me velle totam Adastram nudum corporis mei truncum videre?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:219
translate latin a1s5_5cac312c:

    # "Alex hugs himself, shuddering."
    "Alex se amplectitur et horrescit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:221
translate latin a1s5_5dc99612:

    # al "\"It's so embarrassing.\""
    al "\"Tam pudendum est.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:222
translate latin a1s5_2857c22b:

    # "I sigh and sit back on the bed, only now noticing that Cassius is on the screen, playing some sort of brass instrument that looks to be vaguely in the shape of a French horn."
    "Suspiro atque in lecto reclino; tum demum video Cassium in imagine quoddam instrumentum aeneum canentem, quod vix ad formam cornu Gallici accedit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:223
translate latin a1s5_223d507b:

    # "It sounds nothing like one, though."
    "Sonus tamen minime talis est."

# game/a1s5.rpy:224
translate latin a1s5_608dbc8b:

    # "The volume is low, but I can hear the raspy, sputtering sound it's making."
    "Quamquam sonus demissus est, raucum ac crepitantem concentum quem edit audio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:225
translate latin a1s5_92577730:

    # "Not pleasant to my ear, but then the idea of what music and dance is seems to very different from Earth."
    "Auribus meis non placet; sed quid musica saltatioque sint hic longe aliter quam in Terra intellegi videtur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:226
translate latin a1s5_ec35379b:

    # m "\"Well, I'd prefer being half-naked. And if this is my introduction to the moon, why am I all covered up like this? I'm pretty sure they'd rather get a better look at what I {i}actually{/i} look like.\""
    m "\"At ego seminudus esse mallem. Et si hac occasione lunae populo ostendor, cur ita totus tectus sum? Credo eos potius videre velle qualis {i}re vera{/i} sim.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:227
translate latin a1s5_e8b6b494:

    # "But as I'm saying that I wonder if maybe that's WHY Amicus had me so covered up."
    "Sed dum hoc dico, quaero mecum an haec IPSA sit causa cur Amicus me ita texerit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:229
translate latin a1s5_c734a6cf:

    # al "\"The dress looks very good actually...it's the makeup that surprises me. I suppose it's very...Wolven to do something like that.\""
    al "\"Vestis quidem pulcherrima est...pigmentum autem me mirari facit. Puto hoc genus rei valde...Lupinum esse.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:230
translate latin a1s5_98d23ae4:

    # "I look at Alex, frowning."
    "Alex aspicio, fronte contracta."

# game/a1s5.rpy:231
translate latin a1s5_6fd07c86:

    # m "\"Wolven? Is this offensive?\""
    m "\"Lupinum? Estne hoc contumeliosum?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:233
translate latin a1s5_a6af77fa:

    # al "\"Uhhhh...maybe just a smidge, but not to the wolves, so you have nothing to worry about. The Hindos don't talk to Adastra anymore.\""
    al "\"Hemmm...fortasse paulum, sed non lupis; itaque nihil est quod timeas. Hindi enim iam cum Adastra non colloquuntur.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:234
translate latin a1s5_a99eb27e:

    # m "\"Oh my god...\""
    m "\"Di boni...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:235
translate latin a1s5_a87c28a3:

    # "I want to bury my face in my hands, but I can't with all the make up on."
    "Vultum manibus tegere cupio, sed tantis pigmentis illitis id facere nequeo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:236
translate latin a1s5_7c5630ee:

    # "On top of that, it's all starting to itch."
    "Praeterea, omnia prurire incipiunt."

# game/a1s5.rpy:237
translate latin a1s5_c1c3bbce:

    # m "\"This is so stupid.\""
    m "\"Tam stultum est.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:239
translate latin a1s5_a22b59f6:

    # "Alex chuckles."
    "Alex subridet."

# game/a1s5.rpy:240
translate latin a1s5_1102eba4:

    # al "\"It really is. The Wolves are so obsessed with spectacle and drama which is why the trials are used instead of elections...or even just sound judgment from a council.\""
    al "\"Est quidem. Lupi spectaculis atque rebus scaenicis tam dediti sunt ut certaminibus potius quam comitiis utantur...vel sano consilii iudicio.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:241
translate latin a1s5_3e15e2c0:

    # "Alex gestures up at one of the screens."
    "Alex ad unam tabularum imaginum gestu indicat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:243
translate latin a1s5_2650667f:

    # al "\"It's an Adastran holiday right now so everyone can watch this.\""
    al "\"Nunc dies festus Adastranus est, ut omnes hoc spectare possint.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:244
translate latin a1s5_73337d4d:

    # "Cassius has finished his little song, standing up and bowing."
    "Cassius breve carmen suum confecit; surgit atque se inclinat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:245
translate latin a1s5_f3c87b53:

    # "Along the right edge of the screen, five little boxes pop up, each one containing the faces of three wolves sitting solemnly side-by-side."
    "In dextro imaginis margine quinque parva quadrata apparent, quorum singula tres luporum vultus ostendunt, graviter iuxta se sedentium."

# game/a1s5.rpy:246
translate latin a1s5_26bb3316:

    # al "\"Though, in a way, the people are having a role in choosing their emperor here, with their elected triumvirates making the decision, but then I don't understand why song and dance should apply.\""
    al "\"Quamquam, quodam modo, populus hic in imperatore eligendo partem agit, triumviratibus quos ipse elegit sententiam ferentibus; sed cur cantus saltatioque ad rem pertineant non intellego.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:247
translate latin a1s5_ded4b9ed:

    # m "\"So why would Cassius and Amicus campaign if they're just going to be chosen through these trials?\""
    m "\"Cur igitur Cassius et Amicus suffragia petunt, si his tantum certaminibus eligentur?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:249
translate latin a1s5_ef6dd3ef:

    # al "\"Wellll...if the decision isn't clear, then why not choose the wolf that has the most popularity with your people? It increases the chance of re-election.\""
    al "\"Hem...si iudicium dubium est, cur non lupum eligas qui plurimum apud cives tuos gratiae habet? Ita verisimilius est te rursus electum iri.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:250
translate latin a1s5_22387307:

    # "Amicus suddenly appears on screen, sitting down, a spotlight on him as he begins to blow into the same instrument."
    "Amicus subito in imagine apparet et considit; lumen unum in eum dirigitur, dum idem instrumentum inflare incipit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:251
translate latin a1s5_dea0c0d9:

    # "Again, that raspy, blatting sound that would make me cringe if it were a human instrument at a human concert."
    "Rursus raucus ille boatus auditur, qui me horrere faceret si instrumentum humanum in concentu humano esset."

# game/a1s5.rpy:252
translate latin a1s5_a4cea861:

    # "I have no idea if he's better than Cassius or not."
    "Nescio utrum Cassio melius agat necne."

# game/a1s5.rpy:253
translate latin a1s5_f823ec67:

    # al "\"And general popularity is good to have anyway. A happy people is usually a more peaceful and easy-to-control society.\""
    al "\"Ceterum, gratia apud populum utiliter habetur. Populus contentus plerumque pacatior est faciliusque regitur.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:254
translate latin a1s5_45a95942:

    # m "\"So...Amicus is at a disadvantage then?\""
    m "\"Ergo...Amicus iniquiore condicione est?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:255
translate latin a1s5_455490d5:

    # al "\"Unless he clearly outperforms Cassius.\""
    al "\"Nisi manifeste Cassium superat.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:256
translate latin a1s5_d18fb977:

    # "I sigh, watching as the wolf's cheeks puff up each time he blows into his little horn, his eyes almost crossed with effort."
    "Suspiro lupum spectans: genae eius tument quoties cornu parvum inflat, oculis labore paene distortis."

# game/a1s5.rpy:257
translate latin a1s5_26a8e4ee:

    # m "\"I guess you elect your officials?\""
    m "\"Puto vos magistratus vestros eligere?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:259
translate latin a1s5_8c7583c6:

    # al "\"Yes.\""
    al "\"Ita.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:260
translate latin a1s5_cab6852f:

    # m "\"So does most of...\""
    m "\"Ita quoque pleraeque...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:261
translate latin a1s5_ef07f07d:

    # "I find myself almost saying the name of my planet again."
    "Paene rursus planetae mei nomen pronuntio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:262
translate latin a1s5_1e49b41b:

    # "It's harder and harder to keep this secret from Alex, especially as our relationship has become more casual."
    "Hoc arcanum ab Alex celare magis magisque difficile est, praesertim cum necessitudo nostra familiarior facta sit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:263
translate latin a1s5_0d92c38f:

    # m "\"...our tribes.\""
    m "\"...tribus nostrae.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:264
translate latin a1s5_834b65e8:

    # "At least I think that's what they are on the Simian planet."
    "Saltem puto tales esse in planeta Simiano."

# game/a1s5.rpy:265
translate latin a1s5_51a17e63:

    # "I just have to hope that Alex doesn't actually look it up."
    "Tantum sperare possum Alex rem vere non exploraturum esse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:266
translate latin a1s5_139dc371:

    # "But he continues on like he didn't notice my pause, like he always does."
    "Sed pergit quasi moram meam non animadverterit, ut semper facit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:267
translate latin a1s5_a9d03b3a:

    # al "\"Anyway, despite the competition, I still consider you a friend and I hope you feel the same. Maybe we can have lunch in the gardens soon, no matter the result?\""
    al "\"Ceterum, etsi inter nos certamen est, te adhuc amicum duco atque spero te idem sentire. Fortasse mox in hortis prandere possumus, quicumque exitus erit?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:268
translate latin a1s5_0180db68:

    # m "\"Yeah, let's do that.\""
    m "\"Ita, faciamus.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:270
translate latin a1s5_315d3ba8:

    # al "\"Wonderful.\""
    al "\"Optime.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:271
translate latin a1s5_19df07f7:

    # "We sit in silence for another ten or so minutes, watching as Amicus finishes his horn-playing."
    "Aliis decem fere minutis taciti sedemus, Amicum spectantes dum cornu canere finit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:272
translate latin a1s5_3e8cc4a8:

    # "Then Cassius takes the spotlight again to begin \"singing\"."
    "Deinde Cassius rursus in lumine stat ut \"cantare\" incipiat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:273
translate latin a1s5_cd424eea:

    # "It's actually just howling, Cass's head leaned back, muzzle tipped toward the ceiling, looking just like a wolf on Earth as it howls to the moon."
    "Re vera ululat tantum, capite retro inclinato rostroque ad laquearia directo, velut lupus in Terra ad lunam ululans."

# game/a1s5.rpy:274
translate latin a1s5_1593ccc6:

    # "I think he's saying words, but I can't really understand, especially with the odd, high pitched tone it has."
    "Puto eum verba dicere, sed non vere intellego, praesertim propter mirum illum acutumque vocis sonum."

# game/a1s5.rpy:275
translate latin a1s5_609c84c2:

    # "Meanwhile, a little gauge pops up in the bottom screen, a needle going back and forth with the pitch of the howl."
    "Interea parvum instrumentum mensurae in parte inferiore tabulae apparet, cuius acus cum altitudine ululatus huc atque illuc movetur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:276
translate latin a1s5_c7ff7a17:

    # al "\"They want that indicator to stay in the middle. It represents better control over their song.\""
    al "\"Volunt indicem illum in medio manere. Id ostendit eos cantum suum melius moderari.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:277
translate latin a1s5_c8304af6:

    # "It's short, only few minutes before it's Amicus's turn, doing much the same as Cassius except his howl is deeper, fuller—"
    "Breve est: post pauca tantum minuta ad Amicum ventum est, qui idem fere quod Cassius facit, nisi quod ululatus eius gravior pleniorque est—"

# game/a1s5.rpy:278
translate latin a1s5_0d0d6b9f:

    # "—a lot better, I think."
    "—multo melior, ut puto."

# game/a1s5.rpy:279
translate latin a1s5_7ecb64bc:

    # "I also like to think that the needle stays in the middle more often than it had for Cassius, but I'm not sure."
    "Credere etiam volo acum saepius in medio manere quam Cassio canente mansit, sed certus non sum."

# game/a1s5.rpy:280
translate latin a1s5_a5a7413e:

    # "Toward the end of Amicus's song, Com's voice crackles gently over our heads."
    "Sub finem cantus Amici vox Com supra capita nostra leniter crepitat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:283
translate latin a1s5_c87e0e34:

    # com "\"Alex, [mc], the dance begins in five minutes. Please proceed to the throne room doors.\""
    com "\"Alex, [mc], saltatio post quinque minuta incipit. Quaeso, ad portas aulae solii contendite.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:284
translate latin a1s5_9e4f6441:

    # "My heart skips a beat as we both stand up, Alex leading the way to the hall."
    "Cor meum paulisper subsistit, dum ambo surgimus et Alex nos ad porticum ducit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:286
translate latin a1s5_18ceb7d7:

    # "I wonder if he's nervous too."
    "Quaero mecum an ille quoque anxius sit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:287
translate latin a1s5_4211cada:

    # "Even though he looks calm, his tail lashes back and forth as we walk."
    "Quamquam tranquillus videtur, cauda eius huc atque illuc flagellat dum ambulamus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:288
translate latin a1s5_fb88936e:

    # "I don't try to talk to him, feeling like we're both a little preoccupied with our own thoughts right now."
    "Cum eo loqui non conor; sentio enim nos ambos nunc cogitationibus nostris aliquantum occupatos esse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:289
translate latin a1s5_e0513ba7:

    # "We get to the big double doors and wait side-by-side."
    "Ad magnas fores geminas pervenimus et alter iuxta alterum exspectamus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:290
translate latin a1s5_4372c1f8:

    # "Alex's paws are folded neatly in front of himself, so I do the same."
    "Alex manus ante se composite tenet; idem igitur facio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:291
translate latin a1s5_d22bda91:

    # "I try to breathe evenly."
    "Aequaliter spirare conor."

# game/a1s5.rpy:292
translate latin a1s5_a3c47e34:

    # "I've never been good in front of big crowds and, even though it's technically only Cato in there, I can't forget the fact that millions of people are going to be watching."
    "Ante magnas turbas numquam bene agere potui; quamquam re vera Cato solus intus est, oblivisci nequeo pluries decies centena milia hominum nos spectatura esse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:293
translate latin a1s5_95e89882:

    # com "\"Dance trial begins in five, four, three, two...\""
    com "\"Certamen saltationis incipit post quinque, quattuor, tria, duo...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:296
translate latin a1s5_e6b5f81d:

    # "The doors slide open and I find myself staring into a darkened throne room, the windows deeply tinted so that only a vague hint of sunlight comes through."
    "Portae se aperiunt; aulam solii obscuratam aspicio, fenestris adeo infuscatis ut tenuis tantum solis lux per eas intret."

# game/a1s5.rpy:297
translate latin a1s5_22df4225:

    # "I immediately see Amicus straight ahead of me, bathed in a bright spotlight."
    "Statim Amicum recta ante me video, clara luce perfusum."

# game/a1s5.rpy:298
translate latin a1s5_57e3ad27:

    # "The same can be said for Cassius, about ten meters to his right."
    "Cassius quoque ita illuminatur, decem fere metris ad dextram eius."

# game/a1s5.rpy:299
translate latin a1s5_2c74b0d7:

    # "Cato sits on the throne, just like in my dream."
    "Cato in solio sedet, sicut in somnio meo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:300
translate latin a1s5_27e602b1:

    # "I also notice Virginia and Neferu sitting next to each other on one of the benches."
    "Virginiam quoque et Neferu iuxta se in uno subselliorum sedentes video."

# game/a1s5.rpy:301
translate latin a1s5_9eb819f2:

    # "That alone makes me even more nervous, but then a voice comes over the PA."
    "Id ipsum me magis etiam anxium facit; deinde vox ex amplificatoribus auditur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:302
translate latin a1s5_ee824575:

    # "Not Com, but someone else, sounding old and frail."
    "Non est Com, sed alius, cuius vox senilis ac debilis sonat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:303
translate latin a1s5_3111f80b:

    # "Wolf" "\"Presenting Pet Alexios from moon Omorfa, and Pet [mc], from planet Simia.\""
    "Wolf" "\"Exhibentur Alexios, Deliciae lunae Omorfae, et [mc], Deliciae planetae Simiae.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:304
translate latin a1s5_c19e675d:

    # "Amicus and Cassius reach out one paw, and Alex starts to walk forward on his toes, looking light and sophisticated."
    "Amicus et Cassius singulas manus porrigunt; Alex in digitis pedum procedere incipit, agilis elegansque visus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:305
translate latin a1s5_9947dd8b:

    # "I quickly follow suit, trying to sort of mimic his walk."
    "Statim idem facio, incessum eius quodam modo imitari conatus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:306
translate latin a1s5_7cc1eebc:

    # "I'd never practiced my entrance with Amicus."
    "Ingressum cum Amico numquam exercueram."

# game/a1s5.rpy:307
translate latin a1s5_5a605bee:

    # "I start to wonder if I'm even more under-prepared than I thought I was."
    "Suspicor me minus etiam paratum esse quam putaveram."

# game/a1s5.rpy:308
translate latin a1s5_c2bf1711:

    # "No time to think about that now."
    "Nunc de hac re cogitandi tempus non est."

# game/a1s5.rpy:309
translate latin a1s5_5725b9de:

    # "I do the best that I can with my stupid, prancing walk before coming to a stop in front of Amicus, reaching out a hand to rest in his big paw."
    "Quam optime possum inepto illo incessu saltitante procedo, deinde coram Amico consisto et manum porrigo ut in magnam eius manum ponam."

# game/a1s5.rpy:311
translate latin a1s5_54e182e5:

    # "He smiles reassuringly down at me, and for some reason, his presence makes me a little less nervous than I had been while waiting alone for the trial to start."
    "Ille desuper mihi consolatorie arridet; nescio cur, sed eius praesentia me minus anxium facit quam eram dum solus certamen incipere exspectabam."

# game/a1s5.rpy:312
translate latin a1s5_3a98a344:

    # "We stand there quietly for a moment, but then that old voice starts up again, but now it's in a howl; high, wavering, and faint."
    "Paulisper taciti ibi stamus; deinde senilis illa vox rursus incipit, nunc autem ululans, acuta, tremula atque tenuis."

# game/a1s5.rpy:313
translate latin a1s5_d363d746:

    # "\"{i}Explorant...adver...viro...{/i}\""
    "\"{i}Explorant...adver...viro...{/i}\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:314
translate latin a1s5_ac6ccd48:

    # "He starts to recite the story in the same howl, but it's hard to hear, and now that there are words—"
    "Eodem ululatu fabulam narrare incipit, sed aegre auditur; nunc autem, cum verba sint—"

# game/a1s5.rpy:315
translate latin a1s5_b77ee861:

    # "Wait...I can't understand it. He's speaking—"
    "Mane...intellegere nequeo. Loquitur—"

# game/a1s5.rpy:317
translate latin a1s5_0b4564ba:

    # "Oh fuck."
    "O, merda."

# game/a1s5.rpy:318
translate latin a1s5_310cdf3b:

    # "The Lingua isn't translating the song."
    "Lingua carmen non interpretatur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:319
translate latin a1s5_04cd0a46:

    # "Immediately, I start to panic as I see Amicus raise up his paw."
    "Statim expavesco, cum Amicum manum tollere video."

# game/a1s5.rpy:321
translate latin a1s5_6f47940a:

    # "I probably have a look of horror on my face, because his reassuring smile has turned to a frown."
    "Vultus meus horrorem fortasse ostendit; risus enim quo me consolabatur in tristitiam mutatus est."

# game/a1s5.rpy:322
translate latin a1s5_032780d8:

    # "Jerkily, I raise up my hand up to touch it to the wolf's paw, trying to stay calm."
    "Abrupte manum tollo ut lupi manum tangam, tranquillus manere conatus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:323
translate latin a1s5_f21effee:

    # "I can do this."
    "Hoc facere possum."

# game/a1s5.rpy:324
translate latin a1s5_d525b76d:

    # "Sure, I attached a lot of the movements to the words in the song, but I remember the order of the poses...I think."
    "Multos quidem motus cum carminis verbis coniunxi, sed ordinem habituum memini...ut puto."

# game/a1s5.rpy:325
translate latin a1s5_9652a90e:

    # "Still, the unexpected blunder has me flustered and stumbling, my movements hesitant and definitely un-elegant."
    "Inopinatus tamen error me perturbat atque titubantem facit, motibus meis cunctantibus ac minime elegantibus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:326
translate latin a1s5_8003da0d:

    # "I'm so frazzled that I don't really have time to dwell on the fact that Alex and Cassius are doing the dance at the same time."
    "Tam perturbatus sum ut ne cogitare quidem possim Alex et Cassium eodem tempore saltare."

# game/a1s5.rpy:327
translate latin a1s5_575273f6:

    # "Are we competing for Cato's and the watching triumvirates' attention?"
    "Num de attentione Catonis triumviratuumque spectantium certamus?"

# game/a1s5.rpy:328
translate latin a1s5_990ac754:

    # "I try to stay focused on Amicus, watching his movements, hoping that I might remember enough of his cues to get through all the movements correctly."
    "Amico intentus manere conor motusque eius observare, sperans me satis signorum eius meminisse ut omnes motus recte perficiam."

# game/a1s5.rpy:329
translate latin a1s5_867a6519:

    # "My falling apart must be affecting Amicus as well, his brow furrowed in confusion, his movements also becoming slower, more hesitant."
    "Perturbatio mea Amicum quoque afficere videtur: fronte perplexe contracta, ipse quoque tardius et cunctantius movetur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:330
translate latin a1s5_9d469299:

    # "Fuck."
    "Merda."

# game/a1s5.rpy:331
translate latin a1s5_55715bc8:

    # "I think I feel sweat running down my face, probably turning my striped makeup into a streaked mess."
    "Sudorem per vultum meum fluere sentire mihi videor; pigmentum lineatum fortasse in deformes maculas mutat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:332
translate latin a1s5_05deaa23:

    # "Several times, I'm caught staring at Amicus, unsure of what to do until I look over at Alex to see what he's doing."
    "Saepe in Amicum intentus haereo, nesciens quid faciam donec Alex aspiciam ut videam quid agat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:334
translate latin a1s5_afa61984:

    # "The cat looks totally in his element, stretching and elongating his body luxuriously in tandem with Cassius."
    "Feles prorsus in suo elemento esse videtur: corpus cum Cassio una suaviter tendit atque explicat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:335
translate latin a1s5_0c0f5821:

    # "The wolf isn't bad himself, taking the clear lead in the dance as he dips and sways with Alex's body."
    "Ne lupus quidem male agit; manifeste saltationem ducit, dum se cum corpore Alex inclinat atque flectit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:336
translate latin a1s5_cee9534d:

    # "Meanwhile, I fumble around with Amicus, watching as the powder on my sweaty arms smears on his fur, leaving long, black smudges on his chest and arms."
    "Ego autem cum Amico ineptis motibus laboro, videns pulverem sudantibus brachiis meis adhaerentem in eius pilos illini, longas maculas nigras in pectore brachiisque relinquentem."

# game/a1s5.rpy:337
translate latin a1s5_e46a2aa9:

    # "Finally, we get to Meera's death and at least I know when this is supposed to happen because I see Amicus reach out dramatically for me."
    "Tandem ad mortem Meerae pervenimus; saltem quando hoc fieri debeat scio, quia Amicum magnifice manus ad me porrigere video."

# game/a1s5.rpy:338
translate latin a1s5_8a3c3503:

    # "This is the only moment in the entire dance that I feel confident in what I'm doing, and I put everything into my swoon...but so does Alex."
    "Hoc solum in tota saltatione tempus est quo quid agam certo scio; totas vires in simulatum animi defectum impendo...sed idem Alex facit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:341
translate latin a1s5_be895559:

    # "Amicus is already next to me to catch me before I can start to fall, but Alex swoons while Cassius is still meters away from him, but the other wolf smoothly glides to his side to catch him."
    "Amicus iam iuxta me est ut me teneat antequam cadere incipiam; Alex autem se deficere simulat cum Cassius adhuc multis metris ab eo distet, sed lupus suaviter ad latus eius delabitur eumque excipit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:342
translate latin a1s5_00dee0a2:

    # "Alex lays there in Cassius's arms, splayed out dramatically, looking somehow serene and distressed at the same time."
    "Alex in Cassii brachiis iacet, magnifice expansus, quodam modo tranquillus simul atque afflictus visus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:343
translate latin a1s5_b94711b6:

    # "The spotlight almost makes the pair glitter, and even I feel like there's a good deal of chemistry between the two of them."
    "Clarum lumen ambos paene scintillare facit; etiam ego inter eos magnam quandam necessitudinem esse sentio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:344
translate latin a1s5_08f45fef:

    # "There had been a small but definite hope on my end that Alex might help us out here, maybe throw the dance in our favor with a fall or stumble, but it looks like he's putting everything into the performance."
    "Paulum sed certo speraveram Alex nos hic adiuturum esse, fortasse cadendo aut titubando saltationem in favorem nostrum vertere; sed totas vires in spectaculum impendere videtur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:345
translate latin a1s5_ddfc30d3:

    # "Cassius, despite his reputation of being weak, looks strong and confident, easily supporting Alex's weight as the cat dips further toward the ground."
    "Cassius, quamquam infirmus habetur, fortis fidensque videtur; pondus Alex facile sustinet, dum feles magis ad solum inclinatur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:346
translate latin a1s5_480cf2a6:

    # "At the same time, the wolf's howl reaches a new pitch, the climax of the story."
    "Eodem tempore ululatus lupi altiorem sonum attingit: fabulae culmen."

# game/a1s5.rpy:347
translate latin a1s5_f54cd2f1:

    # "And that's when Alex turns his head to Cassius for a deep, passionate kiss."
    "Tum Alex caput ad Cassium vertit atque eum alto ardentique osculo contingit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:349
translate latin a1s5_9569173f:

    # "Even though Meera's supposed to be gone at this point, Alex reaches up to caress Cassius's face, pulling him in deeper."
    "Quamquam Meera iam mortua esse debet, Alex manum tollit vultumque Cassii mulcet, eum propius attrahens."

# game/a1s5.rpy:350
translate latin a1s5_93ea01d0:

    # "Meanwhile, their bodies press closely together, Cassius very clearly grinding his hips against the cat's, the paw that's not supporting Alex instead running up his thigh—"
    "Interea corpora eorum arcte cohaerent; Cassius manifeste coxas suas contra felis coxas terit, manu autem quae Alex non sustinet per femur eius sursum mota—"

# game/a1s5.rpy:351
translate latin a1s5_f8f06bcf:

    # "—before dipping under Alex's underwear, pushing it up until most of the cat's thigh is showing."
    "—deinde sub indusium Alex immissa, quod tollit donec maxima pars femoris felis pateat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:352
translate latin a1s5_9361ac90:

    # "And they just...writhe against each other like that, as if caught in the throes of passion, the movements of their muzzles telling me that a lot is going on past those lips."
    "Atque ita...inter se volutantur, velut ardore cupiditatis capti; motus rostrorum mihi ostendunt multa ultra illa labra agi."

# game/a1s5.rpy:353
translate latin a1s5_87ac7f06:

    # "The entire act stuns me, almost making me forget about the disaster that our own dance had been."
    "Tota res me stupefacit, ita ut paene obliviscar quam male nostra saltatio evenerit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:354
translate latin a1s5_1d236729:

    # "Cassius turns, carrying Alex with him as he faces them in the other direction, never breaking the kiss, in fact their groping and grinding getting even more intense."
    "Cassius se vertit Alex secum ferens, ut ambo in alteram partem spectent; osculum numquam intermittitur, immo tactus eorum atque corporis frictiones vehementiores fiunt."

# game/a1s5.rpy:355
translate latin a1s5_ca1da69a:

    # "He's giving everyone a good view of what's happening."
    "Omnibus clare ostendit quid agatur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:356
translate latin a1s5_96d90880:

    # "If the whole idea of the dance is to capture attention and make the story and feelings believable—"
    "Si totum saltationis propositum est animos attrahere atque fabulam affectusque credibiles facere—"

# game/a1s5.rpy:357
translate latin a1s5_40f16b6b:

    # "—well, I believe them."
    "—certe ego eis credo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:358
translate latin a1s5_1ec705ee:

    # "In fact, I believe there's a lot more going on between the two than I'd originally thought."
    "Immo, inter ambos multo plura agi credo quam initio putaveram."

# game/a1s5.rpy:359
translate latin a1s5_4f04b87c:

    # "That might explain why Alex wouldn't want to hurt Cassius's chances of being emperor."
    "Id fortasse explicat cur Alex spem Cassii imperatoris fiendi laedere nolit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:360
translate latin a1s5_faa6bfca:

    # "Maybe my hopes that Alex would help us were completely naive."
    "Fortasse spes mea Alex nos adiuturum esse omnino simplex erat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:361
translate latin a1s5_348ca4dc:

    # "And that's when I'm suddenly snapped back to reality as I hear Amicus grunt above me."
    "Tum subito ad praesentia revocor, cum Amicum supra me fremere audio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:365
translate latin a1s5_c8d24ff5:

    # "I'd been so enamored with Cassius and Alex's kiss that I'd forgotten our own."
    "Osculum Cassii et Alex tam captus spectaveram ut nostri oblitus essem."

# game/a1s5.rpy:366
translate latin a1s5_45a15763:

    # "Seeing a preview of what I might have to do with Amicus though..."
    "Sed cum praevideam quid mihi cum Amico faciendum esse possit..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:367
translate latin a1s5_4c727759:

    # "I blush, steeling myself, getting ready as the wolf starts to lean down toward me, his lips puckered up slightly."
    "Erubesco, animumque firmo ac me paro, dum lupus ad me inclinari incipit labiis paulum contractis."

# game/a1s5.rpy:368
translate latin a1s5_18096a30:

    # "I ready my own lips, but then suddenly Amicus turns his head to the side slightly, landing the kiss on my cheek instead."
    "Labra quoque mea paro; sed Amicus subito caput paulum in latus vertit atque genam meam potius osculatur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:369
translate latin a1s5_4bc9a7db:

    # "It's soft and fleeting, and before I know it, Amicus has pulled back before gently lowering me to the cold marble below."
    "Mite breveque est; antequam sentiam, Amicus recessit ac leniter me in frigidum marmor infra demisit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:372
translate latin a1s5_a2c72c42:

    # "I recognize the word Adastra in the howl before everything goes quiet."
    "Verbum Adastra in ululatu agnosco antequam omnia silent."

# game/a1s5.rpy:373
translate latin a1s5_77ebde85:

    # "I hear Alex getting up just a few feet away, so I do the same, Amicus quickly hurrying over to help me up in my dress."
    "Alex paucis pedibus a me surgere audio; idem igitur facio, dum Amicus celeriter advenit ut mihi stolam gerenti surgere auxilietur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:374
translate latin a1s5_c4e1b9fb:

    # "It's only then that I see the various drones floating around above us, the attached lenses making me realize that they're cameras."
    "Tum demum varia automata supra nos volantia video; lentes eis affixae me docent haec imagines capere."

# game/a1s5.rpy:375
translate latin a1s5_16d91e82:

    # "I quickly duck my head, not wanting the people to see the smeared, offensive makeup on my face."
    "Statim caput demitto, nolens populum pigmentum contumeliosum in vultu meo illitum aspicere."

# game/a1s5.rpy:376
translate latin a1s5_103bbff5:

    # "Amicus holds me close to his side, not saying anything, thankfully."
    "Amicus me prope latus suum tenet nihilque dicit, quod mihi gratum est."

# game/a1s5.rpy:377
translate latin a1s5_90a6aed1:

    # "Cassius continues to look straight ahead and I can see Alex glancing at us, looking confused."
    "Cassius adhuc recta ante se spectat; Alex autem nos oblique aspicientem video, perplexum visum."

# game/a1s5.rpy:378
translate latin a1s5_a878c870:

    # "Then Com's voice—"
    "Deinde vox Com—"

# game/a1s5.rpy:379
translate latin a1s5_c06914b3:

    # com "\"The triumvirates have made their decisions.\""
    com "\"Triumviratus sententias suas tulerunt.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:380
translate latin a1s5_ab87d680:

    # com "\"Lupas: Cassius.\""
    com "\"Lupas: Cassius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:381
translate latin a1s5_9f8bbc6d:

    # com "\"Ad Rotae: Cassius.\""
    com "\"Ad Rotae: Cassius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:382
translate latin a1s5_b0d89cbb:

    # com "\"Lux: Cassius.\""
    com "\"Lux: Cassius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:383
translate latin a1s5_9cf22962:

    # com "\"Gebii: Cassius.\""
    com "\"Gebii: Cassius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:384
translate latin a1s5_d09071ad:

    # com "\"Tricelli: Cassius.\""
    com "\"Tricelli: Cassius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:385
translate latin a1s5_ce90c583:

    # com "\"Adastra?\""
    com "\"Adastra?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:386
translate latin a1s5_61801520:

    # "The camera drones swivel to focus on Cato."
    "Automata imagines capientia se vertunt ut Catonem spectent."

# game/a1s5.rpy:387
translate latin a1s5_638c98a4:

    # "He shifts on his throne before grunting out his answer."
    "Ille in solio se movet, deinde responsum suum fremitu edit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:388
translate latin a1s5_967469f5:

    # ca "\"Cassius.\""
    ca "\"Cassius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:389
translate latin a1s5_7b908acd:

    # com "\"The trial has been decided. Cassius is the victor.\""
    com "\"Certamen iudicatum est. Cassius victor est.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:390
translate latin a1s5_0697cdfe:

    # "There's a moment of stunned silence, then the windows un-tint and the camera drones lazily drift away up into some ceiling compartment."
    "Aliquantisper stupentes silent; deinde fenestrae clarescunt atque automata imagines capientia lente in quoddam laquearis receptaculum evolant."

# game/a1s5.rpy:392
translate latin a1s5_163e978f:

    # "I'm left standing there, looking around at the others."
    "Ibi stans relinquor aliosque circumspicio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:393
translate latin a1s5_dbe187a0:

    # "Cato is walking down the steps from the throne, in the direction of Cassius."
    "Cato gradibus e solio descendit atque ad Cassium contendit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:394
translate latin a1s5_a8dbacaf:

    # "Meanwhile, Virginia is whispering to Neferu behind a fan she's casually waving into her face."
    "Virginia autem Neferu susurrat post flabellum quod placide ante vultum suum agitat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:395
translate latin a1s5_4c8352f8:

    # "Cassius is petting Alex's head, murmuring to him under his breath."
    "Cassius caput Alex mulcet et submissa voce ei murmurat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:397
translate latin a1s5_275f495a:

    # "Finally, Amicus stands awkwardly to my side, not even looking at me, his paws behind his back and his eyes on Cato."
    "Amicus denique inconcinne iuxta me stat, ne me quidem aspiciens, manibus post tergum tenendis oculisque in Catone fixis."

# game/a1s5.rpy:398
translate latin a1s5_81e89092:

    # "I suddenly realize again how stupid I look."
    "Rursus subito intellego quam ridiculus videar."

# game/a1s5.rpy:399
translate latin a1s5_bce5d4ee:

    # m "\"Can I go change?\""
    m "\"Licetne mihi vestem mutare?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:400
translate latin a1s5_a8492353:

    # "I mumble to Amicus, keeping my voice low like everyone else, as if we're in a library, or something."
    "Amico murmuro, voce sicut ceteri demissa, velut in bibliotheca aliove tali loco simus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:402
translate latin a1s5_2f80f450:

    # a "\"Um, sure. Do you want—\""
    a "\"Hem, licet. Visne—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:403
translate latin a1s5_d6d2580b:

    # "I don't let him finish."
    "Eum finire non sino."

# game/a1s5.rpy:404
translate latin a1s5_3ce635ba:

    # "I'm walking as fast as I can to the double doors, knowing that everyone's eyes are on my back as I pause to touch the black panel."
    "Quam celerrime possum ad fores geminas ambulo, sciens omnes me a tergo aspicere dum consisto ut tabulam nigram tangam."

# game/a1s5.rpy:408
translate latin a1s5_b95f91f4:

    # "Once I'm in the main hall, I'm able to breathe a little easier, starting to feel the anger coming up through the absolute humiliation."
    "Simul ac in atrio principali sum, paulo facilius spirare possum atque iram per summam ignominiam oriri sentio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:409
translate latin a1s5_d49d7f8c:

    # "I don't know exactly what I'm angry at."
    "Nescio quidnam mihi iram moveat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:410
translate latin a1s5_a10a4c5d:

    # "Not Amicus, even though he maybe should have had an idea that howls don't translate."
    "Non Amicus, quamquam fortasse intellegere debuit ululatus non verti in linguam meam."

# game/a1s5.rpy:411
translate latin a1s5_da6e97a5:

    # "Not Cato or the triumvirates; they'd made the right decision."
    "Neque Cato neque triumviratus: recte enim iudicaverunt."

# game/a1s5.rpy:412
translate latin a1s5_5649fce7:

    # "I'd been a complete disaster out there."
    "Foris prorsus infeliciter egeram."

# game/a1s5.rpy:413
translate latin a1s5_446b61b5:

    # "I guess I'm just mad at this whole system, that the responsibility of getting home rests on me just as much as the guy that got me here in the first place."
    "Puto me toto hoc rerum ordine irasci: cura domum redeundi tam in me quam in eo posita est qui me huc omnino adduxit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:414
translate latin a1s5_d8a25815:

    # "It isn't fair."
    "Non est aequum."

# game/a1s5.rpy:415
translate latin a1s5_0e715722:

    # "So I guess I am pissed at Amicus in a way, but the anger is a lot broader than that, I'm angry at the entire situation."
    "Ita credo me quodam modo Amico irasci; sed ira mea multo latius patet: toti huic rerum condicioni irascor."

# game/a1s5.rpy:418
translate latin a1s5_3be80643:

    # "I go straight to the bathroom, roughly trying to yank off the stupid dress."
    "Recta in balneum vado atque ineptam illam stolam violenter detrahere conor."

# game/a1s5.rpy:420
translate latin a1s5_b2d96918:

    # "It's tight around my neck and I spend the next minute doing an awkward dance, trying to find the buttons on the back so I can loosen it."
    "Circa collum arta est; proximum minutum inepto quodam saltu ago, fibulas in tergo invenire conatus ut eam laxem."

# game/a1s5.rpy:421
translate latin a1s5_de838570:

    # "Eventually, I just rip it off before wiggling out of the dress, feeling a little guilty only after I see the beautiful fabric crumpled up on the ground."
    "Tandem eam lacerando solvo, deinde e veste me expedio; paulum tantum culpae sentio cum pulchram vestem in solo corrugatam video."

# game/a1s5.rpy:422
translate latin a1s5_12c12adb:

    # "I stand there, breathing heavily, sweaty and hot."
    "Ibi sto, graviter spirans, sudans atque aestuans."

# game/a1s5.rpy:423
translate latin a1s5_f56edc80:

    # "I look in the mirror and I'm a little surprised to see the makeup still mostly intact on my face."
    "In speculum aspicio et paulum miror quod pigmentum in vultu meo magna ex parte adhuc integrum est."

# game/a1s5.rpy:424
translate latin a1s5_269b5e3e:

    # "Which reminds me; I'm also pissed that the first time I get paraded out to the public, it's in a racist costume and makeup."
    "Id mihi in memoriam revocat me quoque irasci quod, cum primum populo ostendor, habitum pigmentaque quibus alii populi irridentur gero."

# game/a1s5.rpy:426
translate latin a1s5_620236bc:

    # "I get in the shower, letting the hot water run over my face, feeling a little better now that I'm alone with my thoughts...and out of the tight dress."
    "Sub imbrem ingredior aquamque calidam per vultum fluere sino; iam paulo melius me habeo, solus cum cogitationibus meis...et veste arta liberatus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:427
translate latin a1s5_b62dd7c8:

    # "Still, my mood is a bit dark."
    "Animus tamen meus aliquantum tristis est."

# game/a1s5.rpy:428
translate latin a1s5_8d100195:

    # "I guess now I can actually start to consider that I might be living here forever."
    "Credo me nunc vere cogitare posse me hic in perpetuum habitaturum esse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:429
translate latin a1s5_8cea7ebd:

    # "While my mind initially rejects the idea, I guess it's not the worst fate."
    "Quamquam animus meus initio hanc cogitationem respuit, non pessima sors esse videtur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:430
translate latin a1s5_5b3f39a1:

    # "I'll at least be living in a palace with Amicus, and I know he'd take care of me."
    "Saltem in palatio cum Amico habitabo, eumque mei curam habiturum esse scio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:431
translate latin a1s5_98df8710:

    # "At least I think he would."
    "Saltem ita futurum esse puto."

# game/a1s5.rpy:432
translate latin a1s5_90ce1aad:

    # "Maybe this whole pet thing is temporary, and if he loses the trials, he'll just throw me out with the trash, maybe kill me like he'd once mentioned on the ship."
    "Fortasse tota haec condicio Deliciarum temporaria est; si certamina amittet, me inter sordes abiciet, fortasse etiam interficiet, ut olim in nave dixit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:433
translate latin a1s5_5f0f16be:

    # "Under my gloomy contemplations though, I know that that's not the case."
    "Sub his tamen tristibus cogitationibus scio rem ita non se habere."

# game/a1s5.rpy:434
translate latin a1s5_080ab4aa:

    # "He wouldn't do that, but I can't promise myself that I'd be able to keep friendly with him if things really do go south."
    "Hoc non faceret; sed mihi polliceri nequeo me amicitiam cum eo servare posse si res vere in malum cadant."

# game/a1s5.rpy:435
translate latin a1s5_974aa331:

    # "He'd told me this would be easy so many times."
    "Totiens mihi dixerat hoc facile fore."

# game/a1s5.rpy:437
translate latin a1s5_1d58eab3:

    # "Even if the Lingua hadn't messed up, I doubt we still would have won."
    "Etiamsi Lingua non erravisset, dubito an victores futuri fuerimus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:438
translate latin a1s5_b5912efa:

    # "After a good half hour, I finally get out of the shower."
    "Post plenam fere dimidiam horam tandem ex imbre egredior."

# game/a1s5.rpy:440
translate latin a1s5_e4363b7f:

    # "I stand in front of the fans for a bit, enjoying the way it whips my hair around before I pick up some underwear off the hook and tie it on."
    "Paulisper ante flabella sto, gaudens quod capillos meos agitant; deinde indusium ab unco sumo atque mihi alligo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:442
translate latin a1s5_b5520618:

    # "I'm pretty fast at doing that now, not even having to think about it."
    "Iam id celerrime facio, ne cogitare quidem opus est."

# game/a1s5.rpy:443
translate latin a1s5_ea39fbfa:

    # "Finally, I open the door."
    "Tandem ianuam aperio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:446
translate latin a1s5_ffe221cd:

    # "The cool air that rushes in is refreshing after such a hot shower, but I'm immediately treated to the sight of Amicus walking away from the door, probably in the middle of pacing."
    "Frigidus aer qui intrat post tam calidum imbrem me reficit; sed statim Amicum a ianua recedentem video, fortasse dum huc atque illuc ambulat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:447
translate latin a1s5_43f14fc6:

    # "He immediately turns around at the sound though, his eyes wide."
    "Ad sonum tamen statim se vertit, oculis dilatatis."

# game/a1s5.rpy:450
translate latin a1s5_42904937:

    # a "\"Hey! [mc], how are you?\""
    a "\"Heus! [mc], ut vales?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:451
translate latin a1s5_8e732c02:

    # m "\"Great.\""
    m "\"Optime.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:452
translate latin a1s5_55a134da:

    # "I walk over to the dresser, opening the one that's full of children's robes."
    "Ad armarium accedo atque partem vestibus puerilibus plenam aperio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:454
translate latin a1s5_af121244:

    # a "\"Really?\""
    a "\"Revera?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:455
translate latin a1s5_910f899d_1:

    # m "\"Sure.\""
    m "\"Sane.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:456
translate latin a1s5_19535f1b:

    # "I hear Amicus huff behind me."
    "Amicum post me anhelare audio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:458
translate latin a1s5_342ce654:

    # a "\"Please, I don't want to deal with that mood of yours right now. I just want to talk.\""
    a "\"Quaeso, nunc istum animum tuum ferre nolo. Loqui tantum volo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:459
translate latin a1s5_40036353:

    # "That's fair, but him telling me to stop sulking is just making me sulkier."
    "Aequum est; sed cum me morosum esse vetat, magis etiam morosus fio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:460
translate latin a1s5_49742c09:

    # m "\"You know, I would have loved to just talk like, a week ago about this stupid trial. Imagine how much better it would have gone if I'd actually MEMORIZED the dance rather than just following cues from you and the song.\""
    m "\"Scisne, libentissime de hoc inepto certamine ante hebdomadem tantum collocutus essem. Cogita quanto melius cessisset si saltationem vere MEMORIA DIDICISSEM, non tantum tua carminisque signa secutus essem.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:461
translate latin a1s5_d1c3f61b:

    # "I whip out a robe."
    "Vestem eicio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:462
translate latin a1s5_5b7905b9:

    # m "\"Which, by the way, isn't a song. You always make fun of Earthlings and our primitive ways, but at least we actually have a variety of music. Oh, and we can actually sing, not those creepy howling sounds that sound like you're dying.\""
    m "\"Quod, ceterum, ne carmen quidem est. Semper Terrigenas moresque nostros primitivos irrides, sed saltem varia musica nobis est. Etiam canere vere possumus, non terribiles illos ululatus edere quibus mori videamini.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:463
translate latin a1s5_e2e1711a:

    # "Amicus frowns at me, his ears flat."
    "Amicus fronte contracta me aspicit, auribus demissis."

# game/a1s5.rpy:465
translate latin a1s5_b7d83b26:

    # a "\"You're upset.\""
    a "\"Perturbatus es.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:466
translate latin a1s5_da841932:

    # m "\"Noooo, what made you think that?\""
    m "\"Minimeee, quid te ita putare fecit?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:468
translate latin a1s5_33a3aca3:

    # a "\"Stop it, [mc]. I'm just as upset and disappointed as you probably are...was it the cameras, maybe Cato that made you nervous? What happened?\""
    a "\"Desine, [mc]. Ego aeque perturbatus deceptusque sum ac tu fortasse es...num apparatus imaginum, fortasse Cato, te anxium fecerunt? Quid accidit?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:469
translate latin a1s5_848cf6a9:

    # "I'm quiet for a moment as I start tying on my robe, then suddenly Amicus's paw reaches out, grabbing my right hand and yanking it away from my clothing."
    "Aliquantisper taceo dum vestem alligare incipio; deinde Amicus repente manum porrigit, dextram meam capit atque a veste avellit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:470
translate latin a1s5_8ac50353:

    # m "\"What—\""
    m "\"Quid—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:472
translate latin a1s5_1c1bef42:

    # a "\"What happened to your paw!?\""
    a "\"Quid manui tuae accidit!?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:473
translate latin a1s5_e70b4fe7:

    # "I look up and see the wolf staring at the palm side of my hand with wide eyes before turning it this way and that."
    "Suspicio et lupum palmam meam dilatatis oculis intuentem video; deinde manum huc atque illuc vertit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:474
translate latin a1s5_df8ec4bc_1:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"Quid?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:475
translate latin a1s5_4b4d8fbe:

    # a "\"Your skin it's...it's bunching up! Are you having a reaction to the powder?\""
    a "\"Cutis tua...in rugas contrahitur! Num pulvis corpus tuum laedit?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:476
translate latin a1s5_8c4ff8cd:

    # "I stare at him, confused before pulling my hand away to look at my pruney fingers."
    "Perplexus eum aspicio, deinde manum retraho ut digitos corrugatos videam."

# game/a1s5.rpy:477
translate latin a1s5_6d958df2:

    # m "\"No, I was just in the shower too long. My skin does that when I'm wet for a long time.\""
    m "\"Non, tantum nimis diu sub imbre fui. Cutis mea ita fit cum diu madidus maneo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:478
translate latin a1s5_132d1aad:

    # a "\"I've never noticed that before.\""
    a "\"Hoc antea numquam animadverti.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:479
translate latin a1s5_ea2adea3:

    # m "\"You take short showers.\""
    m "\"Tu breviter lavaris.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:481
translate latin a1s5_1f1229a1:

    # "The wolf frowns at me, then snatches my hand up again to stare at the fingers in fascination, even as I try to yank it back."
    "Lupus fronte contracta me aspicit; deinde rursus manum meam corripit ut digitos admirans intueatur, etsi eam retrahere conor."

# game/a1s5.rpy:482
translate latin a1s5_85455094:

    # "At that point, I feel my mood about to take a turn in one of two directions: either exploding at Amicus in frustration and anger over everything...or just laughing."
    "Tum animum meum alterutram in partem mox iturum sentio: aut in Amicum ira atque desperatione de omnibus rebus erumpam...aut ridebo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:483
translate latin a1s5_805a3c9d:

    # "And I find myself doing the latter, chuckling at first before letting out a loud guffaw."
    "At alterum facio: primum subrideo, deinde clare cachinnor."

# game/a1s5.rpy:484
translate latin a1s5_a67fb761:

    # "Amicus gives me a strange look, finally letting me go."
    "Amicus mirum in modum me aspicit, tandem manum remittens."

# game/a1s5.rpy:485
translate latin a1s5_6ffd912b:

    # a "\"Are you sure you're alright? You're worrying me.\""
    a "\"Certusne es te bene valere? Sollicitum me facis.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:486
translate latin a1s5_11892b9f:

    # "I sigh as I finish tying on my robe before flopping back onto the bed, hands above my head as I let the pleasant, cool air drift down from the ceiling to blanket my body."
    "Suspiro dum vestem alligare finio, deinde me in lectum abicio manibus supra caput positis, dum iucundus frigidusque aer e laqueari delapsus corpus meum circumdat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:487
translate latin a1s5_5059dfe0:

    # "I know I'm going to get cold in a few minutes, but for now it feels good."
    "Scio me post pauca minuta frigus sensurum esse, sed interim iucundum est."

# game/a1s5.rpy:488
translate latin a1s5_0e9b1c5f:

    # m "\"Remember how you said the Lingua has trouble translating some things?\""
    m "\"Meministine te dixisse Linguam quasdam res aegre interpretari?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:489
translate latin a1s5_7a535c43:

    # a "\"Yes, I—\""
    a "\"Memini, ego—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:491
translate latin a1s5_7fa4319c:

    # "I hear the wolf pause as he figures out what went wrong."
    "Lupum tacere audio, cum intellegit quid male evenerit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:492
translate latin a1s5_2b3aff93:

    # m "\"Heard nothing but wailing Latin in that howling noise. I had no idea what I was doing.\""
    m "\"In illo ululatu nihil nisi Latinum ploratum audivi. Quid agerem prorsus nesciebam.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:494
translate latin a1s5_e1993f2a:

    # a "\"Oh gods...\""
    a "\"Di boni...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:495
translate latin a1s5_691b4f26:

    # "There's a heavy thump and I feel the mattress crater and tilt sideways a bit as Amicus sits down next to me."
    "Gravis pulsus auditur; culcitam subsidere atque paulum in latus inclinari sentio, cum Amicus iuxta me considit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:496
translate latin a1s5_b070bcd0:

    # m "\"So yeah.\""
    m "\"Ita igitur.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:497
translate latin a1s5_f5aff05e:

    # a "\"[mc], I'm so sorry. I didn't even contemplate that possibility!\""
    a "\"[mc], tantopere me paenitet. Ne hanc quidem possibilitatem cogitavi!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:498
translate latin a1s5_1abd2645:

    # m "\"It's fine...I don't think either of us could have.\""
    m "\"Bene est...puto neutrum nostrum eam cogitare potuisse.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:499
translate latin a1s5_0dcc5823:

    # a "\"I mean, I've listened to music from the cats before, and I've never had an issue with lyrics translating...\""
    a "\"Musica felium antea audita, verba carminum interpretari mihi numquam difficile fuit...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:500
translate latin a1s5_8619f2c6_1:

    # "I shrug."
    "Umeros tollo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:501
translate latin a1s5_06272fce:

    # m "\"I dunno, doesn't the Lingua try to understand intention, too? Maybe I'm meant to hear the 'true' language when you guys sing. It was happening while you were doing your song, even though I didn't realize it then.\""
    m "\"Nescio; nonne Lingua etiam quid significare velimus intellegere conatur? Fortasse 'veram' linguam audire debeo cum canitis. Id accidebat cum carmen tuum caneres, quamquam tum non intellexi.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:503
translate latin a1s5_8d79f2fa:

    # a "\"Oh...you heard me sing?\""
    a "\"Oh...me canentem audivisti?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:504
translate latin a1s5_1f941374:

    # "I can hear the embarrassment in Amicus's voice."
    "Pudorem in voce Amici audio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:505
translate latin a1s5_02696606:

    # m "\"Yeah...it sounded fine, honestly. I was just being a dick earlier.\""
    m "\"Audivi...bene sonabat, re vera. Antea tantum insolenter agebam.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:507
translate latin a1s5_f27c8d9c:

    # a "\"I know.\""
    a "\"Scio.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:508
translate latin a1s5_1d843b80:

    # m "\"But still, I'm tired of you trashing on human culture.\""
    m "\"Tamen, satis iam habeo te cultum humanum contemnentem.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:510
translate latin a1s5_f27c8d9c_1:

    # a "\"I know.\""
    a "\"Scio.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:511
translate latin a1s5_ab8291d7:

    # m "\"And I {i}knew{/i} that makeup was offensive by the way. I looked like an idiot for all of Adastra to see.\""
    m "\"Et ceterum {i}sciebam{/i} pigmentum illud contumeliosum esse. Stultus omnibus Adastranis spectantibus videbar.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:513
translate latin a1s5_e52df36d:

    # a "\"You looked good!\""
    a "\"Pulchre conspiciebaris!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:514
translate latin a1s5_ca54d236:

    # "I turn my head toward the wolf."
    "Caput ad lupum verto."

# game/a1s5.rpy:515
translate latin a1s5_13b14e9e:

    # m "\"Oh really, fumbling around like an idiot with no clue of what he's doing looks good?\""
    m "\"Re vera? Stultum titubantem, quid agat omnino nescientem, pulchre conspici putas?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:517
translate latin a1s5_1e2cc053:

    # "Amicus stays quiet this time."
    "Hoc tempore Amicus tacet."

# game/a1s5.rpy:518
translate latin a1s5_234839c9:

    # "I stare back up at the ceiling."
    "Rursus laquearia suspicio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:519
translate latin a1s5_d8906f4b:

    # m "\"I guess at least I'm keeping up the dumb, primitive ape act, right?\""
    m "\"Saltem stulti rudisque simii personam ago, nonne?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:520
translate latin a1s5_2ac1b71d:

    # "Amicus just sighs, getting up."
    "Amicus tantum suspirat ac surgit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:521
translate latin a1s5_f5d7f9d8:

    # "I watch as he slowly walks over to the sofa to sit down."
    "Eum lente ad lectum mollem ambulare video ut considat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:523
translate latin a1s5_fb8715c7:

    # a "\"I have to say that although you are a very kind, intelligent person, you're very frustrating when you get into these moods.\""
    a "\"Dicendum mihi est: quamquam benignissimus et intellegentissimus es, valde molestus fis cum talis animi es.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:524
translate latin a1s5_f6af47f1:

    # m "\"Frustrating?\""
    m "\"Molestus?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:525
translate latin a1s5_0bd3f161:

    # a "\"Just so...gloomy and self-defeating. You remind me of Cassius sometimes.\""
    a "\"Tam...tristis es atque adversus te ipsum pugnas. Interdum Cassium mihi in memoriam revocas.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:526
translate latin a1s5_f75ad5bd:

    # "I pull a face."
    "Vultum contorqueo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:527
translate latin a1s5_67681e1a:

    # m "\"Since when is HE self-defeating? He seems pretty full of himself to me.\""
    m "\"Ex quo ILLE contra se ipsum agit? Mihi valde sibi placere videtur.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:528
translate latin a1s5_b6df19c2:

    # a "\"You don't know the real Cass. He very much dislikes himself.\""
    a "\"Verum Cass non novisti. Valde se ipsum odit.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:529
translate latin a1s5_6cba67d9:

    # m "\"Also, don't compare me to your brother. I really don't want to be thinking about him right now.\""
    m "\"Ceterum, noli me cum fratre tuo comparare. De eo nunc prorsus cogitare nolo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:531
translate latin a1s5_848728ea:

    # a "\"I'm just saying, I prefer you in lighter spirits. It suits you more.\""
    a "\"Tantum dico me te hilariorem malle. Id te magis decet.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:532
translate latin a1s5_85d47c6b:

    # m "\"I'll work on it.\""
    m "\"Operam dabo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:533
translate latin a1s5_0619d6f0:

    # "A long silence goes by and with the way that Amicus is shifting around, I can tell that he wants to ask me something."
    "Diu tacemus; ex eo quod Amicus huc atque illuc se movet intellego eum aliquid a me quaerere velle."

# game/a1s5.rpy:534
translate latin a1s5_3ffe5d76:

    # m "\"What is it?\""
    m "\"Quid est?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:536
translate latin a1s5_42a11706:

    # a "\"Well, uh, I guess that little celebration is out of the question, now?\""
    a "\"Hem, puto parvam illam celebrationem iam fieri non posse?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:537
translate latin a1s5_1c18a0dd:

    # m "\"The dinner?\""
    m "\"Cenam?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:539
translate latin a1s5_3c6c8a0b:

    # a "\"Um...\""
    a "\"Ehm...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:540
translate latin a1s5_ebe169cc:

    # "I sit up suddenly, giving him an incredulous look."
    "Subito me erigo atque incredulus eum aspicio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:541
translate latin a1s5_20710e9d:

    # m "\"Seriously!?\""
    m "\"Re vera!?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:543
translate latin a1s5_7686489e:

    # a "\"Whoa, I was just kidd—\""
    a "\"Heus, tantum ioca—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:544
translate latin a1s5_9388858f:

    # m "\"We just lost the trial! You're one trial away from losing the emperorship and you're seriously thinking about that—\""
    m "\"Modo certamen amisimus! Uno tantum alio certamine amisso imperium perdes, et de illa re serio cogitas—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:546
translate latin a1s5_ff4c1277:

    # a "\"I was just having a bit of fun.\""
    a "\"Tantum paulum iocabar.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:547
translate latin a1s5_37a44a46:

    # m "\"No, you want a pity handy.\""
    m "\"Non: vis ut te miserationis causa manu oblectem.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:549
translate latin a1s5_1e8d4df8:

    # a "\"It's not like I NEED you to do it. I can get the job done myself.\""
    a "\"Non est quod OPUS mihi sit te id facere. Ipse opus perficere possum.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:550
translate latin a1s5_ef822471:

    # m "\"Then do it.\""
    m "\"Fac igitur.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:551
translate latin a1s5_ea040d9f:

    # a "\"I will.\""
    a "\"Faciam.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:552
translate latin a1s5_ec9b9d0c:

    # "Amicus sits there huffily, not making eye contact."
    "Amicus ibi indignabundus sedet neque oculos meos intuetur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:553
translate latin a1s5_96c1a1de:

    # "I sigh, remembering what the wolf had said about improving my mood."
    "Suspiro, memor quae lupus de animo meo emendando dixerit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:554
translate latin a1s5_0280c633:

    # "I often criticize Amicus for his tantrums, reminding him that it won't help us to sulk."
    "Saepe Amicum propter iracundiam reprehendo, monens nihil nobis prodesse si morosi simus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:555
translate latin a1s5_f24bc583:

    # "It's kind of hypocritical that I don't hold myself to the same standards."
    "Aliquantum inconstans est quod me ipsum ad easdem normas non exigo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:556
translate latin a1s5_faaa7e88:

    # m "\"Sorry, I've just got a lot on my mind, obviously.\""
    m "\"Ignosce; multa nunc animo versantur, ut patet.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:558
translate latin a1s5_a0a98e31:

    # a "\"Listen, I know this went much differently than what we had planned, but I will certainly win the next trial. I've debated Cassius many times before.\""
    a "\"Audi: scio hoc longe aliter quam constitueramus evenisse, sed proximum certamen certe vincam. Cum Cassio saepe antea disputavi.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:559
translate latin a1s5_13cc5f34:

    # m "\"Do I have to do anything?\""
    m "\"Mihi aliquid faciendum est?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:560
translate latin a1s5_d5f2c265:

    # a "\"Other than watch? No.\""
    a "\"Praeter spectandum? Nihil.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:561
translate latin a1s5_d9143fab:

    # m "\"When is it?\""
    m "\"Quando fiet?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:562
translate latin a1s5_8aa102b4:

    # a "\"Two weeks from now.\""
    a "\"Post duas hebdomades.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:563
translate latin a1s5_8659068a:

    # m "\"You'd better win.\""
    m "\"Vincas oportet.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:564
translate latin a1s5_ea040d9f_1:

    # a "\"I will.\""
    a "\"Faciam.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:565
translate latin a1s5_1e9270dc:

    # "I sigh again, realizing that the knot I've had in my stomach the past few weeks has a bit longer to stick around."
    "Iterum suspiro; intellego anxietatem quae has ultimas hebdomades ventrem meum constrinxit paulo diutius mansuram esse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:566
translate latin a1s5_0ce493b2:

    # m "\"And I might still...\""
    m "\"Et fortasse etiam...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:567
translate latin a1s5_8ed4aa57:

    # "I make a jacking motion in the air."
    "Gestum masturbantis in aere facio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:568
translate latin a1s5_65270a7b:

    # m "\"...later on. I'm just not in the right state of mind right now.\""
    m "\"...postea. Nunc tantum non apto animo sum.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:570
translate latin a1s5_11b99674:

    # a "\"I understand. It was too early to make light of things...though, uh, maybe we could do something else that would make us both feel better?\""
    a "\"Intellego. Nimis mature res leviter tractavi...sed, hem, fortasse aliud facere possumus quo ambo melius nos habeamus?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:571
translate latin a1s5_41d63ee8:

    # m "\"Something else?\""
    m "\"Aliud?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:573
translate latin a1s5_513d3004:

    # a "\"Yes, like, I could just...hold you?\""
    a "\"Ita; fortasse te tantum...amplecti possem?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:574
translate latin a1s5_32cc6e34:

    # "Amicus's voice gets uncharacteristically high on the last word."
    "In ultimo verbo vox Amici praeter consuetudinem acuta fit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:575
translate latin a1s5_9ed7282c:

    # m "\"Hold me.\""
    m "\"Me amplecti.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:576
translate latin a1s5_785fb1c7:

    # "I repeat his words."
    "Verba eius repeto."

# game/a1s5.rpy:577
translate latin a1s5_93436c41:

    # m "\"Why would you want to do that?\""
    m "\"Cur hoc facere velis?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:579
translate latin a1s5_0492a42c:

    # a "\"Well, companionship is part of pet duties, and holding, or embracing is often how it is expressed. It might also be comforting to you considering how stressful the past few hours have been.\""
    a "\"Societatem praebere pars officiorum Deliciarum est; saepe tenendo sive amplectendo exprimitur. Te quoque consolari possit, cum ultimae horae tam anxiae fuerint.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:581
translate latin a1s5_a9da3ed0:

    # "Again, that hopeful look and again I actually feel bad for him."
    "Rursus vultum illum spe plenum video et rursus eum vere miseror."

# game/a1s5.rpy:582
translate latin a1s5_5d90d281:

    # "How lonely do you have to be to just want to cuddle someone?"
    "Quam solus esse debes ut tantum aliquem amplecti cupias?"

# game/a1s5.rpy:583
translate latin a1s5_e0b2c0ad:

    # "But at the same time, I want to."
    "Sed simul ego quoque cupio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:584
translate latin a1s5_6700513a:

    # "I might not want to admit it, but I've also been lonely these past three weeks, emotionally and physically."
    "Fortasse hoc fateri nolo, sed his tribus hebdomadibus ego quoque solus fui, animo atque corpore."

# game/a1s5.rpy:585
translate latin a1s5_1aef7217:

    # "Also, I've really liked our short hugs, so a longer one..."
    "Praeterea, breves nostri amplexus mihi valde placuerunt; longior igitur..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:586
translate latin a1s5_491cdce3:

    # "Trying not to look too eager myself, I sigh and stand up."
    "Cavens ne ipse nimis cupidus videar, suspiro atque surgo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:588
translate latin a1s5_43c2b231:

    # "Amicus's ears immediately perk up in happy surprise."
    "Amicus statim aures laeta admiratione erigit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:589
translate latin a1s5_7ed7a18c:

    # "He leans back, legs together, waiting as I walk up to him."
    "Reclinat se, cruribus coniunctis, et exspectat dum ad eum accedo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:591
translate latin a1s5_ae40e799:

    # a "\"Do you—\""
    a "\"Num—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:593
translate latin a1s5_7b57d90d:

    # "I sit down in his lap, a little awkwardly at first as I wobble around, then finally settle on turning sideways, knees drawn up as I lean my shoulder against his chest."
    "In gremio eius consido, primum aliquantum inconcinne dum vacillo; tandem in latus me verto genibus subductis, umero pectori eius innixo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:594
translate latin a1s5_d64597e0:

    # "Amicus pauses, then wraps his arms around me."
    "Amicus paulisper haeret, deinde brachia circa me ponit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:596
translate latin a1s5_09d70b5a:

    # "Despite the awkward start, I'm amazed at the way I just sort of fit against the curve of his body."
    "Quamquam initium inconcinnum fuit, miror quam apte curvae corporis eius accommodatus sim."

# game/a1s5.rpy:597
translate latin a1s5_10c54a1a:

    # "His big, furry arms envelop me, and I feel the muscles tighten briefly before relaxing."
    "Magna villosaque brachia me circumdant; musculos paulisper intendere sentio, deinde relaxari."

# game/a1s5.rpy:598
translate latin a1s5_eb82cebe:

    # "His soft stomach cushions against my side, making it feel as if I'm leaning a against a big, furry, but firm water bed."
    "Mollis venter eius latus meum sustinet, velut magnae villosaeque culcitae aqua repletae, sed firmae, innitar."

# game/a1s5.rpy:599
translate latin a1s5_bcf4c00d:

    # "His chest is broad and thick, propping my head up comfortably as he scoots his butt out a bit to help us better recline."
    "Pectus eius latum crassumque caput meum commode sustinet, dum nates paulum promovet ut facilius reclinemur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:600
translate latin a1s5_e3c26bc9:

    # "Then he tucks my head under his chin, and just like that, I'm surrounded by his warmth, the cold that had started to bite at my bare skin dissipating immediately."
    "Deinde caput meum sub mentum suum recipit; statim calore eius circumdor atque frigus quod cutem nudam mordere coeperat continuo dissipatur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:601
translate latin a1s5_9780fde3:

    # "I feel a little thrill in my chest at the feeling of having this wolf, so large and powerful, hug and cuddle me so gently."
    "Iucundum quendam motum in pectore sentio, cum lupus tam magnus potensque me tam leniter amplectitur atque fovet."

# game/a1s5.rpy:602
translate latin a1s5_d3e507d3:

    # "Something about that is so...nice."
    "Est in hac re aliquid tam...iucundum."

# game/a1s5.rpy:603
translate latin a1s5_37ebbb2f:

    # "Amicus just holds me in silence for a while, and I feel his paws shift around a bit, like he's kneading through the robe to the skin on my back."
    "Amicus aliquantisper tantum me tacitus tenet; manus eius paulum moveri sentio, velut per vestem cutem dorsi mei subigant."

# game/a1s5.rpy:604
translate latin a1s5_5319a1e3:

    # "Finally, his deep voice rumbles through his chest and against my ear."
    "Tandem gravis vox eius per pectus atque contra aurem meam resonat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:606
translate latin a1s5_34344d7a:

    # a "\"Is this alright?\""
    a "\"Estne hoc bene?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:607
translate latin a1s5_0c4ccb85:

    # m "\"Yeah this is...fine.\""
    m "\"Ita, hoc...bene est.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:608
translate latin a1s5_03f47600:

    # "I blush, embarrassed at how much I'm enjoying this."
    "Erubesco, pudens quod tanto gaudio hoc fruor."

# game/a1s5.rpy:609
translate latin a1s5_6f2652e4:

    # "Originally, I'd just wanted to make him feel better, but he was right about this making ME feel better."
    "Initio tantum eum solari volueram; sed recte dixit hoc etiam ME refecturum esse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:610
translate latin a1s5_28f12dca:

    # "Amicus rubs his chin down against the top of my head, and I hear him inhale."
    "Amicus mentum per summum caput meum fricat eumque inspirare audio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:611
translate latin a1s5_2c099a54:

    # a "\"I suppose this isn't a normal thing to do on Earth?\""
    a "\"Puto hoc in Terra fieri non solere?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:612
translate latin a1s5_93a20f57:

    # m "\"Well...it is if you're dating someone. It's not a usual thing with friends, though.\""
    m "\"Hem...fit, si cum aliquo intimam consuetudinem inisti. Inter amicos tamen non solet.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:613
translate latin a1s5_8e5d5cd5:

    # a "\"Ah.\""
    a "\"Ah.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:614
translate latin a1s5_f40e76e6:

    # "Amicus paws at me a bit more, making those tiny movements as if he's trying to feel me as much as possible without being obvious about it."
    "Amicus paulo magis me manibus tractat, minutis illis motibus, velut quam plurimum me sentire cupiat sine manifesta ostentatione."

# game/a1s5.rpy:615
translate latin a1s5_ee00515d:

    # a "\"What is dating on your planet?\""
    a "\"Quid est intimam consuetudinem inire in planeta tuo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:616
translate latin a1s5_7aad1fdb:

    # "I shrug, though it's hard to do against the wolf's tight embrace."
    "Umeros attollo, quamquam in tam arcto lupi amplexu difficile est."

# game/a1s5.rpy:617
translate latin a1s5_c1554b7e:

    # m "\"Just...asking someone you like out on a date. Basically it just means that you like the person and you want to know more about them and dating helps you do that.\""
    m "\"Tantum...eum qui tibi placet rogas ut tecum conveniat. Id fere significat illum tibi placere atque te plura de eo cognoscere velle; talis consuetudo id adiuvat.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:618
translate latin a1s5_27344ab7:

    # a "\"Ah, Sounds fairly casual. So how does one initiate dating?\""
    a "\"Ah, satis liberum videtur. Quomodo igitur tales congressus incipiuntur?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:619
translate latin a1s5_3689bd46:

    # m "\"I dunno, just ask them...give them flowers if you're old-fashioned, but it is pretty casual, honestly.\""
    m "\"Nescio, tantum rogas...flores das si antiquis moribus uteris; sed re vera satis liberum est.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:620
translate latin a1s5_31826191:

    # a "\"Mmmh.\""
    a "\"Mmmh.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:621
translate latin a1s5_ee424f49:

    # m "\"Why are you so curious?\""
    m "\"Cur tam multa scire cupis?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:622
translate latin a1s5_ed4885e5:

    # "It's Amicus's turn to shrug."
    "Nunc Amicus umeros attollit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:623
translate latin a1s5_c194d5ea:

    # a "\"I always want to be careful about your boundaries. It's easier when I understand your culture better.\""
    a "\"Semper cavere volo ne fines tuos excedam. Facilius est cum cultum tuum melius intellego.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:625
translate latin a1s5_5838500f:

    # "I lean against the wolf, realizing that even though I'd made a complete fool out of myself just half an hour earlier, I feel fine."
    "Lupo innitor, intellegens me bene valere quamquam ante dimidiam tantum horam prorsus ridiculus fueram."

# game/a1s5.rpy:626
translate latin a1s5_742fe3f2:

    # "I kind of hope that this isn't the last time we do something like this."
    "Spero quodam modo hoc non ultimum tempus fore quo aliquid tale faciamus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:627
translate latin a1s5_d9c1feb3:

    # "Knowing Amicus, it likely won't be."
    "Amicum cum noverim, verisimile est non ultimum fore."

# game/a1s5.rpy:631
translate latin a1s5_4723e127:

    # "It's a few days later when I'm finally able to hang out with Alex like we'd planned."
    "Paucis post diebus tandem cum Alex tempus agere possum, ut constitueramus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:632
translate latin a1s5_b139c363:

    # "Cassius had stepped up his campaigning over the past several days as his chances of becoming emperor increased."
    "Cassius per ultimos dies diligentius suffragia petiverat, cum spes eius imperii adipiscendi cresceret."

# game/a1s5.rpy:633
translate latin a1s5_16874e38:

    # "So did Amicus after his decreased."
    "Idem Amicus fecerat, cum sua spes deminuta esset."

# game/a1s5.rpy:634
translate latin a1s5_fd3e6a87:

    # "The difference being that Alex often found himself going on campaign trips with the white wolf while Amicus always left me behind."
    "Hoc intererat: Alex saepe cum albo lupo ad suffragia petenda proficiscebatur; Amicus autem me semper relinquebat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:635
translate latin a1s5_03b5d5ea:

    # "I think Amicus had picked up on the fact that I don't like being out in front of so many people after the whole dance incident."
    "Puto Amicum post totam illam saltationis rem intellexisse me coram tam multis hominibus esse nolle."

# game/a1s5.rpy:636
translate latin a1s5_34fa4f63:

    # "Still, he promises me that WHEN he wins the next trial, we'll go out to the city to celebrate."
    "Tamen promittit nos, CUM proximum certamen vincet, in urbem profecturos esse ut celebremus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:637
translate latin a1s5_fe2172c3:

    # "For now though, I'm happy to stay in the gardens with Alex, enjoying a quiet midday meal as we both talk and sip our tea."
    "Interim tamen libenter in hortis cum Alex maneo, quieto prandio fruens, dum ambo colloquimur atque theam sorbemus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:639
translate latin a1s5_c5558f53:

    # al "\"Honestly, they should have us redo the dance if your Lingua wasn't translating.\""
    al "\"Re vera saltationem nobis iterandam esse iubere debent, si Lingua tua verba non interpretabatur.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:640
translate latin a1s5_a9c28662:

    # m "\"Was yours?\""
    m "\"Tua interpretabatur?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:642
translate latin a1s5_07e60801:

    # al "\"Well, no, but I knew it wouldn't. Wolves never intend for their lyrics to translate over the Lingua because it ruins the howl, which they see to be the whole point of singing.\""
    al "\"Non, sed id futurum sciebam. Lupi carminum verba per Linguam verti numquam volunt: ita ululatus corrumpitur, quem totum canendi propositum esse putant.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:643
translate latin a1s5_61ca8fa6:

    # m "\"Hmm.\""
    m "\"Hmm.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:644
translate latin a1s5_fa01022d:

    # al "\"I could understand Amicus overlooking that though. Most wolves never see another sibling species in person in their entire lives.\""
    al "\"Amicum tamen id praeteriisse intellegere possum. Plerique lupi per totam vitam neminem alterius speciei Fratrum corpore ipso vident.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:645
translate latin a1s5_30313647:

    # m "\"Well, it's over now. On to the debate thing they're gonna do next.\""
    m "\"Iam tamen res finita est. Nunc ad disputationem illam quam deinde habituri sunt transeamus.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:647
translate latin a1s5_755f833b:

    # al "\"Oh yes. Cassius has been training with the best rhetorician on the moon; Marcus Manius.\""
    al "\"Ah, ita. Cassius apud optimum huius lunae rhetorem exercetur: Marcum Manium.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:648
translate latin a1s5_d0a8914c:

    # "I notice that he puts a bit of emphasis on the name and I look over at him."
    "Animadverto eum nomen paulo gravius pronuntiare atque ad eum aspicio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:649
translate latin a1s5_8d68dc44:

    # "Alex sips at his tea daintily, watching the fountain lazily."
    "Alex theam eleganter sorbet, fontem otiose intuens."

# game/a1s5.rpy:651
translate latin a1s5_a103548b:

    # al "\"He's offered Cassius many tips on convincing the triumvirates. Very useful tips, actually. Is Amicus doing anything similar?\""
    al "\"Multa consilia Cassio dedit quibus triumviratibus persuadeat. Consilia quidem utilissima. Amicusne simile aliquid facit?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:652
translate latin a1s5_f8604b98:

    # "I realize then that Alex is offering me information on what Cassius is doing to prepare for the trial."
    "Tum intellego Alex mihi indicare quid Cassius ad certamen se paraturus agat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:653
translate latin a1s5_df26235f:

    # "...At least I think he is."
    "...Saltem ita puto."

# game/a1s5.rpy:654
translate latin a1s5_374186b6:

    # "Whether that's the case or not, I try to remember the name of the rhetoric guy, knowing I should tell Amicus later."
    "Sive ita est sive non, nomen rhetoris memoria tenere conor, sciens me postea Amico dicere debere."

# game/a1s5.rpy:655
translate latin a1s5_d9d6a99b:

    # m "\"I'm not really sure. He hasn't told me all that much about what he's doing, but hopefully it's something similar.\""
    m "\"Non certo scio. Parum mihi dixit de iis quae facit; spero tamen simile aliquid esse.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:656
translate latin a1s5_82e5c16e:

    # al "\"Well, I recommend he study the triumvirates and their cities, if only to find the best way to convince them during the second trial.\""
    al "\"Suadeo ut triumviratus urbesque eorum cognoscat, vel tantum ut optimam rationem in secundo certamine eis persuadendi inveniat.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:657
translate latin a1s5_ce5d7fbf:

    # "Yep, definitely offering me information."
    "Ita, certe me certiorem facit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:658
translate latin a1s5_6efa4ce1:

    # "Thing is, after seeing the way he and Cassius interacted...I wonder if I can fully trust him."
    "Sed postquam vidi quomodo ille Cassiusque inter se agerent...quaero an omnino ei confidere possim."

# game/a1s5.rpy:659
translate latin a1s5_cefe972c:

    # m "\"You know, Cassius was saying something earlier while I was serving him about a week ago. Did you know he has plans to get rid of the triumvirates?\""
    m "\"Scisne Cassium ante hebdomadem aliquid dixisse dum ei ministrabam? Sciebasne eum triumviratus tollere velle?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:661
translate latin a1s5_823e8689:

    # "Alex's eyes widen for a moment."
    "Oculi Alex paulisper dilatantur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:663
translate latin a1s5_91f8afae:

    # al "\"Oh really? Hmm, I wonder why?\""
    al "\"Re vera? Hmm, quaero cur.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:664
translate latin a1s5_f1b90553:

    # m "\"Something about it being easier to rule directly rather than through elected officials?\""
    m "\"Dixit facilius esse ipsum regere quam per magistratus suffragiis electos?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:666
translate latin a1s5_3791602d:

    # al "\"Well, that's some radical thinking, isn't it?\""
    al "\"Satis novae res cogitantur, nonne?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:667
translate latin a1s5_e5e47c93:

    # m "\"That's what Virginia said.\""
    m "\"Id Virginia dixit.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:669
translate latin a1s5_1046ff4a:

    # al "\"Well, she's always been rather reasonable. Honestly—\""
    al "\"Illa semper satis prudens fuit. Re vera—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:670
translate latin a1s5_923d2253:

    # "Alex leans in, lowering his voice."
    "Alex se ad me inclinat et vocem demittit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:672
translate latin a1s5_0deb5748:

    # al "\"I'd rather she become the empress, but unfortunately the Wolves don't allow females to hold positions of much authority, so her chances at the throne are nil.\""
    al "\"Mallem eam imperatricem fieri; sed infeliciter Lupi feminas magna auctoritate fungi non sinunt, itaque nulla eius spes solii est.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:674
translate latin a1s5_0e4c5325:

    # "Alex's eyes suddenly widen as he looks over my shoulder."
    "Alex subito oculos dilatat, ultra umerum meum aspiciens."

# game/a1s5.rpy:675
translate latin a1s5_e40c78fb:

    # "I raise my eyebrows, then look back to see Neferu making his way toward us."
    "Supercilia tollo, deinde respicio et Neferu ad nos accedentem video."

# game/a1s5.rpy:677
translate latin a1s5_7ced5ac2:

    # "I turn around to see Alex looking down toward the ground, his tail lashing around before he holds it in his lap."
    "Me verto atque Alex terram aspicientem video, cauda huc atque illuc agitata antequam eam in gremio tenet."

# game/a1s5.rpy:679
translate latin a1s5_cbc14406:

    # "The jackal stops to stand in front of us."
    "Chacalus ante nos consistit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:680
translate latin a1s5_a0b2d750:

    # "Without a word, he delicately takes one of Alex's paws and bows low to kiss it."
    "Sine verbo unam manuum Alex delicate capit atque se demittit ut eam osculetur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:681
translate latin a1s5_831fa7c5:

    # "Alex raises his other paw to his mouth, blushing furiously."
    "Alex alteram manum ori admovet, vehementer erubescens."

# game/a1s5.rpy:682
translate latin a1s5_bfcbc323:

    # "Meanwhile, Neferu just nods at me."
    "Neferu autem mihi tantum annuit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:683
translate latin a1s5_70e40f00:

    # n "\"Good day Alex and [mc]. How is your midday meal?\""
    n "\"Bonum diem, Alex et [mc]. Quomodo prandium vestrum se habet?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:684
translate latin a1s5_bb33bcd2:

    # "Alex still has his paw to his mouth, so I answer for him."
    "Alex adhuc manum ori admovet; itaque ego pro eo respondeo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:685
translate latin a1s5_e8c65d81:

    # m "\"It's okay. How are you?\""
    m "\"Bene est. Tu ut vales?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:687
translate latin a1s5_bdcc289c:

    # n "\"Splendid!\""
    n "\"Optime!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:688
translate latin a1s5_97646432:

    # "I notice then that he's carrying a bottle in his paw, the glass glinting in the sunlight with his every move."
    "Tum video eum ampullam manu tenere, vitro in sole scintillante quoties se movet."

# game/a1s5.rpy:689
translate latin a1s5_e2998297:

    # n "\"I was just taking a walk through the gardens this morning when I happened across a shockingly large spider that skittered across the ground at my paws.\""
    n "\"Hodie mane per hortos tantum ambulabam, cum subito araneam mirabiliter magnam offendi, quae ante pedes meos per terram celeriter cucurrit.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:690
translate latin a1s5_62259dac:

    # "Neferu sweeps his paw in front of himself, as if showing where the spider ran."
    "Neferu manum ante se movet, velut ostendens ubi aranea cucurrerit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:692
translate latin a1s5_27bca162:

    # n "\"I can't help but wonder if I'm in danger here.\""
    n "\"Invitus quaero an hic in periculo sim.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:693
translate latin a1s5_3acf07ff:

    # "Alex finally speaks up then, squeaking with the first syllable."
    "Tum Alex tandem loquitur, prima syllaba stridens."

# game/a1s5.rpy:694
translate latin a1s5_000d9a32:

    # al "\"N—no, they're rather harmless. Their venom is very mild.\""
    al "\"M—minime: satis innocuae sunt. Venenum earum leve est.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:696
translate latin a1s5_df7b9cd8:

    # n "\"Ah, well that's a relief to hear, Alex. On my home planet I'd often have to shake my loincloths out before wearing them in case of scorpions.\""
    n "\"Ah, hoc audire me levat, Alex. In planeta meo saepe subligacula excutere debebam antequam ea induerem, ne scorpii intus essent.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:698
translate latin a1s5_fc8aa649:

    # al "\"Oh really? That's terrifying.\""
    al "\"Re vera? Terribile est.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:700
translate latin a1s5_6b33373e:

    # n "\"It certainly can be, but it's something you get used to.\""
    n "\"Terribile quidem esse potest, sed ei rei adsuescis.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:701
translate latin a1s5_2a23172c:

    # "Alex and Neferu smile at each other for a moment, and I frown at the cat, wondering what the hell he's doing."
    "Alex et Neferu paulisper alter alteri arrident; ego autem frontem contraho atque felem aspicio, quaerens quid malum agat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:703
translate latin a1s5_bf382732:

    # n "\"Oh yes! I came to give you this.\""
    n "\"Ah, ita! Veni ut hoc tibi darem.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:704
translate latin a1s5_cc243d36:

    # "Neferu leans down and holds out the glass bottle and now I see it's filled with a honey-colored liquid that sloshes lazily in the bottle."
    "Neferu se demittit et ampullam vitream porrigit; nunc video eam liquore mellis coloris plenam esse, qui lente intus agitatur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:706
translate latin a1s5_3b6edbc4:

    # n "\"The Buna seed oil I promised. Much better for the fur than the Adastran oils they have for us.\""
    n "\"Oleum e semine Buna quod promisi. Multo pilis melius quam olea Adastrana quae nobis praebent.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:707
translate latin a1s5_73f3a985:

    # "Alex reaches out and takes the bottle, blushing again."
    "Alex manum porrigit atque ampullam sumit, rursus erubescens."

# game/a1s5.rpy:709
translate latin a1s5_39d5f337:

    # al "\"Th-thank you Neferu. I'll use it first thing tomorrow.\""
    al "\"G—gratias, Neferu. Cras primo mane eo utar.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:710
translate latin a1s5_77a8b79e:

    # n "\"And I'll see you again tomorrow to make sure you do!\""
    n "\"Et cras rursus te videbo ut certe facias!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:712
translate latin a1s5_68c23bea:

    # "The jackal winks and I think I hear Alex make a strangled noise in his throat."
    "Chacalus connivet; puto me Alex strangulatum quemdam sonum in gutture edentem audire."

# game/a1s5.rpy:713
translate latin a1s5_a7a7f5fd:

    # n "\"In the meantime, would you like to take a walk with me?\""
    n "\"Interim, visne mecum ambulare?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:715
translate latin a1s5_8be0a984:

    # al "\"Uh, oh, I—\""
    al "\"Hem, oh, ego—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:716
translate latin a1s5_5e9c6746:

    # "Neferu once again extends a paw."
    "Neferu rursus manum porrigit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:718
translate latin a1s5_d7dc446a:

    # "Alex coughs awkwardly before reaching out to take it."
    "Alex inconcinne tussit, deinde manum porrigit ut eam capiat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:720
translate latin a1s5_75838a24:

    # n "\"Wonderful, you're always such great company. Would you like to join us as well, [mc]?\""
    n "\"Optime; semper iucundissimam societatem praebes. Visne tu quoque nobiscum venire, [mc]?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:721
translate latin a1s5_9e879a0b:

    # "I think back on what had happened in the baths."
    "Memoria repeto quae in balneis acciderunt."

# game/a1s5.rpy:722
translate latin a1s5_b8a3ce0a:

    # m "\"No thanks.\""
    m "\"Nolo, gratias.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:723
translate latin a1s5_3f501016:

    # n "\"In that case, I'll see you around the palace.\""
    n "\"Ita te in palatio iterum videbo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:725
translate latin a1s5_f2bc826b:

    # al "\"Yeah, see ya, [mc]!\""
    al "\"Ita, vale, [mc]!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:729
translate latin a1s5_81f7b5e7:

    # "Neferu offers his arm to the cat, and just like they're off into the gardens, disappearing around the many bushes lining the footpaths."
    "Neferu brachium feli offert; statim ambo in hortos abeunt, inter multos frutices semitas cingentes evanescentes."

# game/a1s5.rpy:730
translate latin a1s5_526722de:

    # "I stare after them, a bit confused, still unclear on what exactly the jackal is doing."
    "Eos aliquantum perplexus intueor, adhuc nesciens quidnam chacalus agat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:731
translate latin a1s5_ab63e441:

    # "I'm also reminded that I need to ask Alex about why the hell he told Neferu about my intelligence."
    "Mihi quoque in memoriam redit me ab Alex quaerere debere cur, malum, Neferu de ingenio meo dixerit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:732
translate latin a1s5_b0491a46:

    # "Only problem is, I don't know how to do that without seeming suspicious."
    "Hoc unum difficile est: nescio quomodo id faciam quin suspectus videar."

# game/a1s5.rpy:733
translate latin a1s5_3e63b78d:

    # "Technically there isn't a reason why it's supposed to be a secret, and I feel like bringing it up will only give the cat reason to dig more deeply."
    "Nulla re vera causa est cur id arcanum esse debeat; timeo ne, si rem attingam, feli causam penitius investigandi dem."

# game/a1s5.rpy:734
translate latin a1s5_fa2ece93:

    # "As I'm wondering all of this, I notice a shape in the bushes, near the ones that Alex and Neferu disappeared behind."
    "Dum haec omnia animo verso, formam quandam in fruticibus video, prope eos post quos Alex et Neferu evanuerunt."

# game/a1s5.rpy:735
translate latin a1s5_ec0ddce1:

    # "Then I see a flash of red and maybe an elbow poking out."
    "Deinde rubrum aliquid et fortasse cubitum prominentem video."

# game/a1s5.rpy:736
translate latin a1s5_9316a441:

    # m "\"What the—Amicus?\""
    m "\"Quid malum—Amice?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:737
translate latin a1s5_b2467365:

    # "I yell out in his direction and I see the wolf jump, suddenly coming out from behind his cover."
    "In eius partem exclamo et lupum resilire video, subito e latebris prodeuntem."

# game/a1s5.rpy:739
translate latin a1s5_4807ec03:

    # a "\"Y—yes, was just having a look at the roses.\""
    a "\"I—ita, rosas tantum spectabam.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:740
translate latin a1s5_a34afdbe:

    # "The wolf walks toward me, his paws behind his back."
    "Lupus ad me ambulat, manibus post tergum positis."

# game/a1s5.rpy:741
translate latin a1s5_83b2a1c1:

    # "I raise an eyebrow at him."
    "Supercilium ad eum tollo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:742
translate latin a1s5_03b3b1f0:

    # m "\"Were you spying on us? Were you trying to avoid Neferu, or something?\""
    m "\"Num nos speculabaris? Neferu vitare conabaris, an quid aliud?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:743
translate latin a1s5_7fc1f32e:

    # "Amicus ignores me this time."
    "Hoc tempore Amicus me neglegit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:745
translate latin a1s5_6e5b7feb:

    # a "\"How was your day, [mc]?\""
    a "\"Quomodo dies tuus fuit, [mc]?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:746
translate latin a1s5_b9e3310e:

    # m "\"Umm...Okaaay.\""
    m "\"Hem...Beneee.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:747
translate latin a1s5_a0341c5e:

    # "I try to look around the wolf's side at whatever he's hiding behind his back, but he turns accordingly to keep it obscured."
    "Circa lupi latus aspicere conor ut videam quid post tergum celet; ille tamen se vertit ut res occultata maneat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:748
translate latin a1s5_9e2304d6:

    # m "\"What are you doing?\""
    m "\"Quid agis?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:749
translate latin a1s5_0fb53a3f:

    # a "\"Well...\""
    a "\"Bene...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:750
translate latin a1s5_05a93913:

    # "Amicus takes a deep breath and I feel myself starting to get nervous."
    "Amicus alte spirat; me anxium fieri incipere sentio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:751
translate latin a1s5_aa9a4062:

    # "Then he goes down to one knee."
    "Deinde in unum genu procumbit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:754
translate latin a1s5_e914e437:

    # a "\"[mc], over the past few weeks I've come to enjoy your company immensely.\""
    a "\"[mc], his ultimis hebdomadibus societate tua maxime delectari coepi.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:755
translate latin a1s5_a2f345f6:

    # "My mouth drops."
    "Os mihi patet."

# game/a1s5.rpy:756
translate latin a1s5_45ded5a4:

    # a "\"And over the past few weeks, I've come to realize that we share so much in common in terms of our goals and desires.\""
    a "\"Atque his ultimis hebdomadibus intellexi nobis tam multa de propositis desideriisque communia esse.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:757
translate latin a1s5_aceadc3b:

    # "Amicus gives me a coy smile at that."
    "His dictis, Amicus mihi verecunde arridet."

# game/a1s5.rpy:758
translate latin a1s5_fe3e2511:

    # m "\"What are you—\""
    m "\"Quid tu—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:759
translate latin a1s5_312b7eaf:

    # a "\"So, I decided that I should take the next step, to make you feel more welcome and to show you how much I appreciate your kindness and understanding.\""
    a "\"Ita constitui proximum gradum faciendum esse, ut te gratius acceptum sentias et scias quanti benignitatem atque intellegentiam tuam aestimem.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:760
translate latin a1s5_5b15d884:

    # "The wolf suddenly swings his paws to his front, revealing what he'd been hiding."
    "Lupus subito manus ante se porrigit et quod celaverat ostendit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:761
translate latin a1s5_acc44c0b:

    # "It's a bouquet of purple flowers, lavenders to be exact, along with several smaller white flowers sprinkled into the mix."
    "Fasciculus florum purpureorum est, lavandulae quidem, cum nonnullis minoribus floribus albis intermixtis."

# game/a1s5.rpy:763
translate latin a1s5_3f932d51:

    # a "\"[mc], will you date me?\""
    a "\"[mc], visne mecum intimam consuetudinem inire?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:765
translate latin a1s5_cd29d082:

    # "I stare at the wolf, still taking in the presentation he'd just given me."
    "Lupum intueor, adhuc considerans quid modo mihi proposuerit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:766
translate latin a1s5_de5b0e1c:

    # "My mouth still hangs open and I make a few \"uh\" sounds as I try to form a coherent sentence to respond in my mind."
    "Os adhuc mihi patet et aliquot \"hem\" sonos edo, dum sententiam compositam qua respondeam animo fingere conor."

# game/a1s5.rpy:768
translate latin a1s5_07af5409:

    # a "\"Ah, I probably messed that up, huh? Well, hopefully the message came across clearly? What do you think?\""
    a "\"Ah, fortasse id male egi, nonne? Sed spero sensum clare percepisse te. Quid censes?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:769
translate latin a1s5_c750b2ca:

    # m "\"I—I'm stunned.\""
    m "\"E—ego stupeo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:771
translate latin a1s5_70d3e4c1:

    # a "\"And that's...good?\""
    a "\"Et hoc...bonum est?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:772
translate latin a1s5_da607eba:

    # m "\"Amicus, what is this?\""
    m "\"Amice, quid est hoc?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:774
translate latin a1s5_3a29d2ae:

    # a "\"I did something wrong, didn't I?\""
    a "\"Aliquid male feci, nonne?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:775
translate latin a1s5_f3aee734:

    # m "\"Well, I mean...did you mean to do it?\""
    m "\"Dico...num id de industria fecisti?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:776
translate latin a1s5_64efc63a:

    # "The whole thing is crazy, but Amicus's demeanor doesn't really match with the proposal he'd just made."
    "Tota res mira est; sed habitus Amici proposito quod modo fecit non plane respondet."

# game/a1s5.rpy:777
translate latin a1s5_52e07f74:

    # a "\"Did I mean to ask you out on a date?\""
    a "\"Num de industria te rogavi ut mecum convenires?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:778
translate latin a1s5_a9ad7fed:

    # m "\"Well...yeah, did you?\""
    m "\"Ita...num voluisti?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:779
translate latin a1s5_8ca1d22f:

    # a "\"Yes?\""
    a "\"Volui?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:780
translate latin a1s5_82660e3e:

    # "Now the wolf is really fidgeting, tugging at his cape nervously as he lowers the bouquet to hang limply at his side."
    "Iam lupus vere inquietus est: pallium nervose vellit, dum fasciculum florum ad latus flaccidum demittit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:781
translate latin a1s5_6b0a828b:

    # "I have an odd butterflies-in-the-stomach feeling that won't seem to go away."
    "Mirum motum in ventre sentio, velut papiliones ibi volent, qui cessare non videtur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:782
translate latin a1s5_e1caa137:

    # "I don't know what it means, but I try to ignore it."
    "Quid significet nescio, sed eum neglegere conor."

# game/a1s5.rpy:783
translate latin a1s5_c4dac397:

    # "The wolf suddenly deflates, looking dejected."
    "Lupus subito languescit atque deiectus videtur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:785
translate latin a1s5_14094755:

    # a "\"Did I pick up the incorrect meaning?\""
    a "\"Num sensum falsum percepi?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:786
translate latin a1s5_a15f46f9:

    # "I clear my throat, trying to gather my wits."
    "Guttur purgo animumque colligere conor."

# game/a1s5.rpy:787
translate latin a1s5_ea1af301:

    # m "\"What, uh, do you think dating is?\""
    m "\"Quid, hem, intimam consuetudinem esse putas?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:789
translate latin a1s5_ef3d4fc8:

    # a "\"Well, what you told me; it's a relationship status that enables you to become closer, learn more about each other, along with normalizing physical intimacy.\""
    a "\"Id quod mihi dixisti: condicio necessitudinis est qua propius coniungi atque plura alter de altero cognoscere possumus, simul familiaritatem corporis solitam faciens.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:790
translate latin a1s5_4478e413:

    # "Well, he seems to have it down for the most part."
    "Pleraque satis bene intellegere videtur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:791
translate latin a1s5_c0312a65:

    # "The part that I'm having trouble with though..."
    "Haec tamen pars mihi difficilis est..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:792
translate latin a1s5_c7eb1d6e:

    # m "\"Well, people that date also tend to have...I guess feelings for each other.\""
    m "\"Qui sic inter se conveniunt etiam...opinor, affectus erga se invicem habere solent.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:794
translate latin a1s5_286d7dd3:

    # a "\"Well yes, I have very friendly feelings toward you, and I want to make you more comfortable around me, especially when it comes to physical intimacy. Isn't that the point of dating?\""
    a "\"Habeo quidem erga te amicissimos affectus; volo te commodius circa me agere, praesertim de familiaritate corporis. Nonne hoc est talium congressuum propositum?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:795
translate latin a1s5_5fd9a0e4:

    # "I sigh, realizing I hadn't explained it well enough, but then I hadn't realized that Amicus was planning to do this either."
    "Suspiro, intellegens me rem non satis explicavisse; sed neque intellexeram Amicum hoc agere parare."

# game/a1s5.rpy:796
translate latin a1s5_7058fe6a:

    # m "\"Well, usually people don't do it unless they love each other...\""
    m "\"Plerumque tamen id non faciunt nisi alter alterum amant...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:797
translate latin a1s5_0756e718:

    # "My voice gets quieter and quieter over the course of the sentence until Amicus has to poke his ears forward to hear me."
    "Per sententiam vox mea magis magisque demittitur, donec Amicus aures porrigere debeat ut me audiat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:798
translate latin a1s5_0b24a914:

    # a "\"Love?\""
    a "\"Amor?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:799
translate latin a1s5_6bff4e6b:

    # m "\"...Yeah.\""
    m "\"...Ita.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:801
translate latin a1s5_69f0220c:

    # a "\"Oh.\""
    a "\"O.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:802
translate latin a1s5_f5f2bbb5:

    # "Amicus stands there a moment before the insides of his ears turn bright red."
    "Amicus paulisper stat, deinde interiores aurium partes ruberrimae fiunt."

# game/a1s5.rpy:806
translate latin a1s5_e37fc829:

    # a "\"You said it was casual!\""
    a "\"Dixisti rem levem esse!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:807
translate latin a1s5_d3b520ee:

    # "The wolf raises his voice, the sudden increase in volume making me jump."
    "Lupus vocem tollit; subita soni vis me resilire facit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:808
translate latin a1s5_3fc5177b:

    # m "\"Well it is! I mean, you don't necessarily have to be {i}in love{/i} to date, but the intention is usually to {i}find{/i} love...\""
    m "\"Levis est! Non necesse est {i}amore captum{/i} esse ut cum aliquo convenias; sed plerumque propositum est amorem {i}invenire{/i}...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:810
translate latin a1s5_cdc16c3a:

    # a "\"Dear gods, was your intention just to humiliate me after the dance?\""
    a "\"Di boni, num me post saltationem tantum humiliare volebas?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:811
translate latin a1s5_d6506fb9:

    # m "\"What the hell are you talking about? How was I supposed to know you were planning this?\""
    m "\"Quid, malum, dicis? Quomodo scire poteram te hoc parare?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:813
translate latin a1s5_00423455:

    # a "\"I think me asking those questions had made it fairly obvious.\""
    a "\"Puto quaestiones meas rem satis manifestam fecisse.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:814
translate latin a1s5_05a5113d:

    # m "\"You assume way too much.\""
    m "\"Nimis multa sumis.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:816
translate latin a1s5_ed8e9401:

    # a "\"Clearly.\""
    a "\"Ut patet.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:817
translate latin a1s5_5c510239:

    # "The wolf tosses the bouquet to the side, letting it land on the bench before it rolls off to the ground."
    "Lupus fasciculum florum in latus abicit; in subsellium cadit, deinde in terram devolvitur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:819
translate latin a1s5_be2630fe:

    # "Amicus slumps onto the bench next to me, his ears still red."
    "Amicus iuxta me in subsellium se demittit, auribus adhuc rubentibus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:820
translate latin a1s5_19eaca18:

    # "I let him grumble to himself for a minute or two, wanting to let him cool off from the initial embarrassment."
    "Sino eum unum alterumve minutum secum murmurare, ut prima pudoris vis remittatur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:821
translate latin a1s5_f1a88c56:

    # "Then I reach up to rest a hand on his broad shoulder."
    "Deinde manum tollo et lato umero eius impono."

# game/a1s5.rpy:822
translate latin a1s5_413e69ef:

    # m "\"Sorry, I didn't mean to embarrass you. Besides, how were you supposed to know? It's an Earth thing.\""
    m "\"Ignosce; te pudere nolui. Ceterum, quomodo scire poteras? Res Terrigenarum est.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:823
translate latin a1s5_73f15cfa:

    # "Amicus waves a paw."
    "Amicus manum agitat."

# game/a1s5.rpy:826
translate latin a1s5_6f08a5b2:

    # a "\"S'fine. Like you said, I assume too much.\""
    a "\"Bene est. Ut dixisti, nimis multa sumo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:827
translate latin a1s5_4a38b0f7:

    # "I lean over to pick up the bouquet, seeing how the flowers just kind of looked bunched together."
    "Me inclino ut fasciculum florum tollam, qui quasi temere inter se congesti sunt."

# game/a1s5.rpy:828
translate latin a1s5_5a6cff89:

    # m "\"You make this yourself?\""
    m "\"Ipse hoc fecisti?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:829
translate latin a1s5_07baf5cc:

    # a "\"Well, yes. The garden has many flowers.\""
    a "\"Feci quidem. Multi flores in horto sunt.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:830
translate latin a1s5_f7bd2aca:

    # m "\"It smells like you.\""
    m "\"Ut tu olet.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:832
translate latin a1s5_8e60af51:

    # a "\"Er, yes.\""
    a "\"Hem, ita.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:833
translate latin a1s5_5b40bdb0:

    # m "\"It looks good.\""
    m "\"Pulcher est.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:835
translate latin a1s5_38471715_1:

    # a "\"Thank you.\""
    a "\"Gratias.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:836
translate latin a1s5_1ec2f81b:

    # "We sit quietly for a few more minutes as I pretend to examine all the flowers in the bouquet."
    "Aliquot minuta taciti sedemus, dum omnes flores fasciculi examinare simulo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:837
translate latin a1s5_13146426:

    # a "\"So...It's either friendship or love with humans? No physical intimacy unless you're bound to fall in love?\""
    a "\"Igitur...apud homines aut amicitia aut amor est? Nulla familiaritas corporis nisi in amorem lapsurus es?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:838
translate latin a1s5_9d3344cb:

    # m "\"What do you mean?\""
    m "\"Quid dicis?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:840
translate latin a1s5_b4dae761:

    # a "\"Like this 'dating' culture you have. You were interested in giving me that sexual favor. Does that mean you're also interested in love with me as well?\""
    a "\"Sicut ista cultura 'congressuum' vestra. Mihi illam voluptatem sexualem praebere volebas. Num igitur mecum amorem quoque inire cupis?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:841
translate latin a1s5_a381710c:

    # "I blush."
    "Erubesco."

# game/a1s5.rpy:842
translate latin a1s5_c5899eca:

    # m "\"Well, not exactly.\""
    m "\"Non prorsus.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:843
translate latin a1s5_7e6a70cc:

    # a "\"Didn't you say dating allows for more intimacy? But dating is also meant to look for love?\""
    a "\"Nonne dixisti consuetudinem maiorem familiaritatem permittere? Sed ea etiam ad amorem quaerendum destinatur?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:844
translate latin a1s5_7f776825:

    # "I sigh and set the bouquet aside."
    "Suspiro atque fasciculum florum depono."

# game/a1s5.rpy:845
translate latin a1s5_62deb1f7:

    # m "\"Things are changing, becoming more...casual.\""
    m "\"Res mutantur, magis...liberae fiunt.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:847
translate latin a1s5_3d01c8fb:

    # "I say the word carefully and Amicus snorts."
    "Verbum caute pronuntio et Amicus fremit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:848
translate latin a1s5_d9711857:

    # m "\"But I guess the term you might be looking for is 'friends with benefits'.\""
    m "\"Sed puto te fortasse quaerere vocabulum 'amici cum commodis'.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:849
translate latin a1s5_fe8c4e90:

    # a "\"Benefits?\""
    a "\"Commodis?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:850
translate latin a1s5_2b8075ea:

    # m "\"Friends that have sex, basically.\""
    m "\"Amici qui concumbunt, fere.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:852
translate latin a1s5_6b247c2c:

    # a "\"Ah, I see. We haven't done that, though.\""
    a "\"Ah, intellego. Id tamen non fecimus.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:853
translate latin a1s5_e8fffe1e:

    # m "\"No. But I'm not gonna make you date me just to get a hand-job.\""
    m "\"Non. Sed te mihi intimam consuetudinem promittere non cogam tantum ut te manu oblectem.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:855
translate latin a1s5_0281ebdc:

    # a "\"Hehe...\""
    a "\"Haha...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:857
translate latin a1s5_24e64e73:

    # "Amicus scratches behind his head before looking away again."
    "Amicus post caput scalpit, deinde rursus avertitur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:858
translate latin a1s5_02057283:

    # "Once again, I find myself feeling bad for him."
    "Iterum eum miseror."

# game/a1s5.rpy:859
translate latin a1s5_d1cd676e:

    # m "\"Listen, if we weren't having this whole—\""
    m "\"Audi, nisi tota haec—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:860
translate latin a1s5_3197c1c2:

    # "I lower my voice."
    "Vocem demitto."

# game/a1s5.rpy:861
translate latin a1s5_1b58451d:

    # m "\"—illegal space adventure, I might say yes.\""
    m "\"—expeditio sideralis contra leges esset, fortasse assentirer.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:863
translate latin a1s5_ea0f8f8b:

    # a "\"What, really?\""
    a "\"Quid, re vera?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:864
translate latin a1s5_d01da12b:

    # m "\"I said 'might'.\""
    m "\"Dixi 'fortasse'.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:866
translate latin a1s5_313fcd7d:

    # a "\"Oh, really?\""
    a "\"Re vera?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:867
translate latin a1s5_3a49b7ff:

    # m "\"I think you're missing a key word there.\""
    m "\"Puto te verbum praecipuum praeterire.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:868
translate latin a1s5_5d65d906:

    # a "\"I think I understand.\""
    a "\"Puto me intellegere.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:869
translate latin a1s5_84fbcda7:

    # "I find myself turning red again, wishing I'd just kept my mouth shut."
    "Rursus erubesco atque opto me os clausum tenuisse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:870
translate latin a1s5_eb50d343:

    # a "\"Well, maybe I might as well.\""
    a "\"Fortasse ego quoque assentirer.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:871
translate latin a1s5_be629f99:

    # m "\"Well, you already asked.\""
    m "\"Iam quidem rogavisti.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:872
translate latin a1s5_216a51a1:

    # a "\"Without knowing the full meaning.\""
    a "\"Sine plena sensus cognitione.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:873
translate latin a1s5_6775398c:

    # "I try to think of something else to change the subject, knowing that my blush is clear as day to the wolf and that he's very much enjoying it."
    "Aliquid aliud excogitare conor ut sermonem mutem, sciens pudorem meum lupo manifestissimum esse atque eum illo maxime delectari."

# game/a1s5.rpy:874
translate latin a1s5_8794f7f0:

    # m "\"Anyway, Alexios told me that Cassius was training under a rhetoric person, um...Markus Manliest, or something?\""
    m "\"Ceterum, Alexios mihi dixit Cassium apud rhetorem exerceri, hem...Marcum Virilissimum, an quid tale?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:876
translate latin a1s5_b5fb7a3a:

    # "Amicus suddenly frowns."
    "Amicus subito frontem contrahit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:877
translate latin a1s5_d2f0e1e1:

    # a "\"Marcus Manius, really?\""
    a "\"Marcus Manius, re vera?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:878
translate latin a1s5_f8b5a36d:

    # m "\"I think that's what he said.\""
    m "\"Puto ita dixisse eum.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:879
translate latin a1s5_607cbcdb:

    # a "\"Damn.\""
    a "\"Malum.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:880
translate latin a1s5_31c13a0e:

    # "Amicus's tone is that of awe."
    "Vox Amici admirationem ostendit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:881
translate latin a1s5_61335156:

    # m "\"Is that bad?\""
    m "\"Estne hoc malum?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:882
translate latin a1s5_773b6a0d:

    # a "\"It's...simply surprising. He's the most famous Adastran rhetorician there is.\""
    a "\"Tantum...mirum est. Celeberrimus omnium rhetorum Adastranorum est.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:883
translate latin a1s5_b5d935dd:

    # m "\"Should I be worried?\""
    m "\"Sollicitus esse debeo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:885
translate latin a1s5_6c54715c:

    # a "\"No, in fact, now that you've told me I'm in much better shape. I now have an idea of what style he might use, so that will make it easier to counter his points.\""
    a "\"Non; immo, nunc cum mihi dixisti, multo meliore condicione sum. Iam suspicor qua dicendi ratione utatur, itaque facilius erit argumentis eius respondere.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:886
translate latin a1s5_745f0138_1:

    # m "\"If you're sure...\""
    m "\"Si certus es...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:888
translate latin a1s5_a265b6db:

    # a "\"Of course! Now come to my room to help me practice, just to make extra certain I'll win.\""
    a "\"Certe! Nunc in cubiculum meum veni ut me exercentem adiuves; ita victoria mihi certior erit.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:892
translate latin a1s5_deabd5ac:

    # "We get up and walk back to the palace through the gardens, leaving the bouquet of flowers behind on the bench."
    "Surgimus et per hortos ad palatium redimus, fasciculo florum in subsellio relicto."

# game/a1s5.rpy:893
translate latin a1s5_04c4dd9c:

    # "Amicus seems to have gotten over his embarrassment about the whole incident pretty quickly."
    "Amicus pudorem de tota illa re satis celeriter deposuisse videtur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:894
translate latin a1s5_17f82a13:

    # "It's just like him to be able to do that, actually"
    "Re vera, id omnino eius morum est"

# game/a1s5.rpy:895
translate latin a1s5_d3affd42:

    # "In fact, we're laughing and talking just as easily as we always have, the wolf nudging me every few minutes to punctuate something he says, each one causing me to stumble."
    "Immo, ridemus atque colloquimur tam facile quam semper; lupus singulis aliquot minutis me impellit ut verba sua confirmet, quo semper titubo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:898
translate latin a1s5_72a65b7d:

    # a "\"Anyway, Cass tends to stutter over his words in front of large crowds. Not much a rhetorician can do about that!\""
    a "\"Ceterum, Cass coram magnis turbis balbutire solet. Rhetor parum de hac re facere potest!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:900
translate latin a1s5_6b2445df:

    # "The wolf reaches out a paw, pressing it to the black square."
    "Lupus manum porrigit et quadrato nigro admovet."

# game/a1s5.rpy:903
translate latin a1s5_eebb2563:

    # a "\"Besides, what exactly is he—\""
    a "\"Praeterea, quidnam ille—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:905
translate latin a1s5_f484922b:

    # "Amicus and I stare in surprise as Cassius stares back at us with what looks like even more surprise."
    "Amicus et ego mirantes Cassium aspicimus, qui maiore etiam admiratione nos respicere videtur."

# game/a1s5.rpy:906
translate latin a1s5_06fbc770:

    # "Then his eyes narrow."
    "Deinde oculos contrahit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:908
translate latin a1s5_e0a89ae0:

    # c "\"Excuse me.\""
    c "\"Permittite.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:909
translate latin a1s5_7c66e91a:

    # "He tries to move around us, but Amicus blocks his way, growling."
    "Circa nos transire conatur, sed Amicus fremens ei viam intercludit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:911
translate latin a1s5_6275a81a:

    # a "\"What the HELL are you doing in here, Cassius!\""
    a "\"Quid MALUM hic agis, Cassi!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:913
translate latin a1s5_bdef24b7:

    # "Amicus seems to reserve his actual yelling only for Cassius, so it makes me jump when I hear it."
    "Amicus veros clamores Cassio soli servare videtur; itaque me resilire facit cum eos audio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:914
translate latin a1s5_e0f556f4:

    # "Cassius collects himself quickly despite Amicus's intimidating snarls."
    "Cassius, quamquam Amicus terribiliter ringitur, celeriter se componit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:916
translate latin a1s5_e0162d1c:

    # c "\"Not much of your business, is it?\""
    c "\"Non multum ad te pertinet, nonne?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:917
translate latin a1s5_3b292880:

    # a "\"If you're in my room then it is my business.\""
    a "\"Si in cubiculo meo es, ad me pertinet.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:918
translate latin a1s5_5fbbe62e:

    # a "\"What. Are. You. DOING!?\""
    a "\"Quid. Tu. AGIS!?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:920
translate latin a1s5_a5c4e2bc:

    # "The wolf starts to advance on Cassius, stopping just feet away."
    "Lupus ad Cassium accedere incipit atque paucis tantum pedibus ab eo consistit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:922
translate latin a1s5_07102c9f:

    # c "\"Move Amicus, otherwise I'm calling Cato.\""
    c "\"Recede, Amice, alioquin Catonem vocabo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:923
translate latin a1s5_4ff680d1:

    # "Amicus eyes Cassius closely, then finally pulls back, folding his arms."
    "Amicus Cassium diligenter inspicit, deinde tandem recedit ac brachia conserit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:925
translate latin a1s5_9e5a3828:

    # a "\"Snooping around to find something that might give you a chance in the trial? I can tell you now that you'll be coming up short.\""
    a "\"Explorasne aliquid quod spem tibi in certamine praebeat? Iam nunc tibi dicere possum nihil te inventurum esse.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:926
translate latin a1s5_344041d5:

    # c "\"Obviously. You've nothing to offer to help me win.\""
    c "\"Ut patet. Nihil habes quod ad victoriam meam prosit.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:928
translate latin a1s5_43b88e8e:

    # a "\"Then why come here?\""
    a "\"Cur igitur huc venisti?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:929
translate latin a1s5_cb5fd7d8:

    # "Cassius ignores the other wolf, walking past Amicus before passing by me."
    "Cassius alterum lupum neglegit; Amicum praeterit atque deinde me."

# game/a1s5.rpy:930
translate latin a1s5_bf84acde:

    # "He turns then."
    "Tum se vertit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:932
translate latin a1s5_3db6cebb:

    # c "\"And you know, I shouldn't be worried after the pitiable display you and your 'pet' put on.\""
    c "\"Nec sollicitus esse debeo, post miserabile spectaculum quod tu et 'Deliciae' tuae praebuistis.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:933
translate latin a1s5_2149161e:

    # "He turns to me and I can't help but frown at him."
    "Ad me se vertit; nec me cohibere possum quin frontem contraham."

# game/a1s5.rpy:934
translate latin a1s5_3a3a6a36:

    # c "\"As stupid as he is ugly.\""
    c "\"Tam stultus quam foedus.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:935
translate latin a1s5_e48b2e23:

    # "I know that Cassius is just trying to get under Amicus's skin."
    "Scio Cassium tantum Amicum irritare conari."

# game/a1s5.rpy:936
translate latin a1s5_6bc6481f:

    # "He knows that he cares about me."
    "Scit me ei carum esse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:937
translate latin a1s5_a408d1aa:

    # "But as Cassius reaches out to brush my chin with a paw, I can't stop myself from batting it away."
    "Sed cum Cassius manum porrigit ut mentum meum tangat, me cohibere non possum quin eam propellam."

# game/a1s5.rpy:939
translate latin a1s5_3a388d08:

    # "Cassius's eyes widen then, and I see his paw draw back."
    "Tum oculi Cassii dilatantur atque manum eius retrahi video."

# game/a1s5.rpy:941
translate latin a1s5_f86a34a9:

    # "I flinch, but immediately Amicus is there, reaching out to grab Cassius by his cape."
    "Resilio; sed Amicus statim adest et pallium Cassii corripit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:946
translate latin a1s5_d8f14b87:

    # "The smaller wolf is pulled back from me, but Amicus doesn't stop there."
    "Minor lupus a me retrahitur, sed Amicus ibi non desistit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:947
translate latin a1s5_f9419c16:

    # "As Cassius stumbles past Amicus, the bigger wolf swings his paw, smacking Cassius square in the nose."
    "Cum Cassius Amicum titubans praeterit, maior lupus manum vibrat atque recta in nasum eum percutit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:949
translate latin a1s5_1fba65db:

    # "Cassius immediately goes down on his ass at which point I hear another sound."
    "Cassius statim in nates cadit; tum alium sonum audio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:951
translate latin a1s5_114d116f:

    # "Amicus and I stare down at the smaller wolf as he sits there, stunned, then he suddenly scrambles up to his feet, a paw to his rear."
    "Amicus et ego minorem lupum desuper aspicimus, dum stupefactus sedet; deinde repente pedibus insistit, manu ad nates admota."

# game/a1s5.rpy:953
translate latin a1s5_f3011b69:

    # c "\"Amicus, you bastard! Tail-raising lover of ASS!\""
    c "\"Amice, spurie! Caudam tollens, CULORUM amator!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:954
translate latin a1s5_1258c9ce:

    # "I take a step back as Cassius practically sprays blood from his mouth."
    "Gradum retro facio, cum Cassius sanguinem ab ore paene spargit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:956
translate latin a1s5_3e25c4fe:

    # "Amicus pulls me to his side, eyes narrowed, but I can feel his heart hammering against my shoulder."
    "Amicus me ad latus suum trahit, oculis contractis; sed cor eius vehementer contra umerum meum pulsare sentio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:957
translate latin a1s5_afc7a7eb:

    # c "\"I'll throw you both in the dungeon for that. I'll have him EXECUTED when I'm emperor!\""
    c "\"Propter hoc ambos in carcerem coniciam. Eum INTERFICI IUBEBO cum imperator ero!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:959
translate latin a1s5_c9eb4b7e:

    # "I see tears start to spill out of Cassius's eyes before he turns and stumbles out of the room, his tail hanging limply to the side."
    "Lacrimas e Cassii oculis fluere video antequam se vertit atque e cubiculo titubans egreditur, cauda flaccida ad latus pendente."

# game/a1s5.rpy:961
translate latin a1s5_56de8bf1:

    # "Amicus and I stand there for a long time after he leaves, the silence almost oppressive after the loud fight."
    "Amicus et ego diu ibi stamus postquam ille abiit; post tam clamosam rixam silentium paene nos premit."

# game/a1s5.rpy:967
translate latin a1s5_fec97169:

    # "To be continued..."
    "Continuabitur..."

translate latin strings:

    # a1s5.rpy:48
    old "I don't know."
    new "Nescio."

